{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019RQwibnF3MSmrwLhDKb4js","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claims systematic降级：(1)''Cross-architecture generalization''→''preliminary\n2\t  cross-model evidence on two architectures''； (2)主finding→''large effect size suggestive\n3\t  of harm, requiring larger N for confirmation''； (3)增加prominent limitations section：power=45%\n4\t  at n=5, Bonferroni NS； (4)structured-vs-random divergence从''proves''→''suggests''；\n5\t  (5)补充2×2 meta-analysis框架(PALADIN+EEF+TaxEI: {positive/negative signal}×{tool-use/planning})提升conceptual\n6\t  novelty； (6)加入explicit power curve showing n=9 threshold for 80% power。 Reviewer\n7\t  mean score 2.8–3.2 (Borderline Accept)。论文可发EMNLP Findings但tone从 ''definitive boundary\n8\t  condition''变为''empirical evidence toward boundary conditions''。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: Recovery Eval Multi-Seed (5-seed × 3 conditions)\n13\t  plan_id: recovery-eval-multiseed\n14\t  description: '将recovery eval从seed=42扩展至全部5个seed (42/0/123/1/7)，覆盖V/T/R三条件。 每条件47\n15\t    tasks × 4 operators (P1/P2/C1/C4) round-robin注入。验证D041 resilience-not-recovery发现的跨seed稳定性。~15\n16\t    GPU-h，需先retrain seed=0/123 checkpoints。\n17\t\n18\t    '\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    vanilla_recovery_5seed_mean_pct: 67.1\n21\t    vanilla_recovery_5seed_sd_pp: 4.9\n22\t    vanilla_recovery_per_seed:\n23\t    - 61.7\n24\t    - 68.1\n25\t    - 66.0\n26\t    - 66.0\n27\t    - 74.5\n28\t    taxei_recovery_5seed_mean_pct: 57.4\n29\t    taxei_recovery_5seed_sd_pp: 6.2\n30\t    taxei_recovery_per_seed:\n31\t    - 59.6\n32\t    - 46.8\n33\t    - 61.7\n34\t    - 61.7\n35\t    - 57.4\n36\t    random_recovery_5seed_mean_pct: 57.9\n37\t    random_recovery_5seed_sd_pp: 6.4\n38\t    random_recovery_per_seed:\n39\t    - 63.8\n40\t    - 55.3\n41\t    - 66.0\n42\t    - 51.1\n43\t    - 53.2\n44\t    recovery_minus_clean_vanilla_pp: -0.2\n45\t    recovery_minus_clean_taxei_pp: -0.9\n46\t    recovery_minus_clean_random_pp: -0.4\n47\t    detection_rate_qwen_all_seeds: 0.0\n48\t    welch_t_taxei_vs_vanilla_recovery_p: 0.03\n49\t    welch_t_bonferroni_significant: false\n50\t    cohens_d_recovery_taxei_vs_vanilla: 1.53\n51\t    per_operator_C4_5seed_taxei_advantage_pp: 1.8\n52\t    per_operator_C4_fisher_p: 0.71\n53\t    per_operator_P2_5seed_taxei_disadvantage_pp: -4.1\n54\t    per_operator_P2_fisher_p: 0.38\n55\t    per_operator_local_global_gradient_replicates: false\n56\t  result_rationale: 'Median档核心参数recovery_clean_rate_match_pp=[0.0, 2.0]。5-seed recovery\n57\t    eval 确认D041的resilience-not-recovery pattern：每条件recovery rate与clean eval rate 偏差<1pp（V:\n58\t    67.1 vs 67.3=-0.2pp; T: 57.4 vs 58.3=-0.9pp; R: 57.9 vs 58.3=-0.4pp）。 模型通过任务完成能力被动忽略eval-time\n59\t    perturbation而非主动检测修正—— recovery rate本质上就是clean task completion rate在noisy evaluation下的表现。\n60\t    Detection rate维持0%（Qwen架构在任何seed/条件下都不产生显式error flagging）。\n61\t\n62\t    Per-operator patterns是关键降级点：seed=42中C4+9.1pp的\"优势\"基于N=11单个task flip(6→7/11)，5-seed聚合后collapse至+1.8pp(Fisher\n63\t    p=0.71 NS)。P2保持weak negative direction(-4.1pp)但同样NS。整个local/global gradient从confirmatory\n64\t    降级为\"directional observation consistent with error cascading hypothesis, requiring\n65\t    >200-task benchmarks for per-operator claims\"。\n66\t\n67\t    这个实验的统计结构：5 seeds × 47 tasks = 235 episodes/condition for aggregate recovery claim\n68\t    (adequate power for ~10pp effect)，但per-operator仅~55-60 episodes (grossly underpowered\n69\t    for ~5pp operator-level effects)。Median档reviewer会accept aggregate resilience finding但要求per-operator移至Appendix。\n70\t\n71\t    '\n72\t  tables:\n73\t  - name: 5-Seed Recovery vs Clean Rate Match\n74\t    content: '| Condition | Clean 5s Mean±SD | Recovery 5s Mean±SD | Δ(Rec−Clean)\n75\t      | Det. Rate |\n76\t\n77\t      |-----------|:----------------:|:-------------------:|:------------:|:---------:|\n78\t\n79\t      | Vanilla   | 67.3 ± 4.7      | 67.1 ± 4.9         | −0.2pp       | 0%        |\n80\t\n81\t      | TaxEI     | 58.3 ± 6.5      | 57.4 ± 6.2         | −0.9pp       | 0%        |\n82\t\n83\t      | Random    | 58.3 ± 8.7      | 57.9 ± 6.4         | −0.4pp       | 0%        |\n84\t\n85\t      '\n86\t  - name: 'Per-Operator TaxEI−Vanilla Δ: Seed=42 vs 5-Seed'\n87\t    content: '| Operator            | Locality | Seed=42 Δ | 5s Mean Δ | 5s SD   |\n88\t      Fisher p |\n89\t\n90\t      |---------------------|:--------:|:---------:|:---------:|:-------:|:--------:|\n91\t\n92\t      | C4_obs_masking      | Local    | +9.1pp    | +1.8pp    | 12.5pp  | 0.71     |\n93\t\n94\t      | P1_step_order_swap  | Mixed    |  0.0pp    | −1.2pp    | 10.8pp  | 0.82     |\n95\t\n96\t      | C1_context_trunc    | Global   | −8.3pp    | −3.4pp    | 11.2pp  | 0.49     |\n97\t\n98\t      | P2_subgoal_deletion | Global   | −8.3pp    | −4.1pp    | 13.1pp  | 0.38     |\n99\t\n100\t      '\n101\t  figures_description:\n102\t  - Recovery Rate vs Clean Eval Rate scatter (15 points = 5 seeds × 3 conditions)，\n103\t    y=x reference line。Points cluster within ±2pp of diagonal，visually confirming\n104\t    resilience-not-recovery。V=blue, T=red, R=orange。\n105\t  - Per-operator dot plot：4 operators × 5 seeds的TaxEI−Vanilla Δ，large scatter 覆盖zero\n106\t    line，seed=42 highlighted as outlier-driven。\n107\t  analysis: '5-seed recovery eval的aggregate finding（recovery≈clean rate）是paper的strongest\n108\t    confirmatory result——不依赖p-value而是qualitative pattern match。但per-operator gradient从Results正文降级至Appendix。Reviewer会accept\n109\t    \"resilience not recovery\" 作为valid finding但不accept per-operator作为stand-alone claim。This\n110\t    experiment changes paper structure: Table 3 (per-operator) moves to Appendix B,\n111\t    replaced by a compact \"recovery≈clean\" comparison table in main text.\n112\t\n113\t    '\n114\t- name: LLaMA-3.1-8B Cross-Model Replication (3-seed)\n115\t  plan_id: llama-cross-model\n116\t  description: '在LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct上复制核心实验：3 seeds (42/0/123) × 3条件 (V/T/R)。 同训练数据、LoRA配置(rank=16,\n117\t    α=32)、eval protocol。验证TaxEI instability 是否跨architecture成立。~36 GPU-h。\n118\t\n119\t    '\n120\t  expected_results:\n121\t    llama_vanilla_recovery_mean: 73.1\n122\t    llama_vanilla_recovery_sd: 2.5\n123\t    llama_vanilla_recovery_seeds:\n124\t    - 74.5\n125\t    - 74.5\n126\t    - 70.2\n127\t    llama_taxei_recovery_mean: 69.5\n128\t    llama_taxei_recovery_sd: 8.6\n129\t    llama_taxei_recovery_seeds:\n130\t    - 74.5\n131\t    - 74.5\n132\t    - 59.6\n133\t    llama_random_recovery_mean: 76.6\n134\t    llama_random_recovery_sd: 2.1\n135\t    llama_random_recovery_seeds:\n136\t    - 74.5\n137\t    - 76.6\n138\t    - 78.7\n139\t    llama_vanilla_clean_mean: 72.3\n140\t    llama_vanilla_clean_sd: 0.0\n141\t    llama_taxei_clean_mean: 71.6\n142\t    llama_taxei_clean_sd: 8.6\n143\t    llama_random_clean_mean: 75.9\n144\t    llama_random_clean_sd: 1.2\n145\t    taxei_sd_over_random_sd: 4.1\n146\t    catastrophic_seed_fraction: 0.33\n147\t    catastrophic_seed_id: s123\n148\t    catastrophic_drop_vs_vanilla_pp: -10.6\n149\t    catastrophic_drop_vs_random_pp: -19.1\n150\t    taxei_mean_vs_random_mean_pp: -7.1\n151\t    taxei_mean_vs_vanilla_mean_pp: -3.6\n152\t    llama_detection_rate_mean: 0.27\n153\t    cross_model_direction_consistent: true\n154\t    welch_t_taxei_vs_vanilla_llama_p: 0.52\n155\t  result_rationale: 'Median档cross_model_taxei_sd_ratio=[3.5, 4.5]，catastrophic_seed_fraction=[0.2,\n156\t    0.33]。\n157\t\n158\t    TaxEI SD=8.6pp vs Random SD=2.1pp → ratio=4.1×，落在区间中间。这个ratio由 single catastrophic\n159\t    seed(s123)驱动：s123 recovery=59.6%（vs vanilla 70.2%=-10.6pp， vs random 78.7%=-19.1pp），而s42/s0均=74.5%（与vanilla持平）。Pattern\n160\t    mirrors Qwen 的catastrophic seed现象但表现形式不同：Qwen是consistent degradation（所有5个seed\n161\t    都低于vanilla），LLaMA是intermittent catastrophe（2/3 neutral, 1/3 catastrophic）。\n162\t\n163\t    Reviewer challenge点：(1)\"n=3的SD estimate有极宽CI——单个outlier就能创造4× ratio\"。 这是valid的——remove\n164\t    s123后TaxEI SD=0pp。但counter-argument是catastrophic seed 本身就是structured injection的核心failure\n165\t    mode。(2)\"LLaMA detection rate 27% vs Qwen 0%——不同architecture在学不同的东西，cross-model\n166\t    comparison的前提被undermined。\" 这需要在paper中讨论为architecture-dependent behavior。(3)\"3\n167\t    seeds on second model is preliminary at best。1/3=33% catastrophic could be 0/10\n168\t    with more seeds。\"\n169\t\n170\t    Random在LLaMA上mildly beneficial(76.6%>vanilla 73.1%,+3.5pp)——与Qwen(Random= Vanilla\n171\t    degraded)形成对比。这支持\"unstructured noise is benign-to-helpful\"但也 表明effect magnitude是model-dependent。Paper必须从\"cross-architecture\n172\t    confirmation\" 降级为\"preliminary evidence on two architectures suggesting direction\n173\t    consistency\"。\n174\t\n175\t    Detection rate差异（LLaMA ~27% vs Qwen 0%）是unexpected finding。LLaMA-3.1的 instruction-following\n176\t    tendency更强，可能使其more likely to verbalize error awareness 即使这种awareness doesn''t\n177\t    translate to improved recovery。这实际上strengthens \"detection ≠ recovery\"的argument但需要careful\n178\t    framing。\n179\t\n180\t    '\n181\t  tables:\n182\t  - name: Cross-Model Recovery Rate Comparison\n183\t    content: '|              | Qwen3-8B (5-seed)  | LLaMA-3.1-8B (3-seed) |\n184\t\n185\t      |--------------|:------------------:|:---------------------:|\n186\t\n187\t      | Vanilla      | 67.3 ± 4.7        | 73.1 ± 2.5           |\n188\t\n189\t      | TaxEI        | 58.3 ± 6.5        | 69.5 ± 8.6           |\n190\t\n191\t      | Random       | 58.3 ± 8.7        | 76.6 ± 2.1           |\n192\t\n193\t      | V−T gap      | −9.0pp             | −3.6pp                |\n194\t\n195\t      | T SD / R SD  | 0.75×              | 4.1×                  |\n196\t\n197\t      | Catastrophic | 1/5 (20%)          | 1/3 (33%)             |\n198\t\n199\t      | Detection    | 0%                 | 27%                   |\n200\t\n201\t      '\n202\t  - name: LLaMA Per-Seed Recovery Breakdown\n203\t    content: '| Condition       | s42   | s0    | s123       | Mean ± SD     |\n204\t\n205\t      |-----------------|:-----:|:-----:|:----------:|:-------------:|\n206\t\n207\t      | Vanilla (rec.)  | 74.5  | 74.5  | 70.2       | 73.1 ± 2.5   |\n208\t\n209\t      | TaxEI (rec.)    | 74.5  | 74.5  | **59.6**   | 69.5 ± 8.6   |\n210\t\n211\t      | Random (rec.)   | 74.5  | 76.6  | 78.7       | 76.6 ± 2.1   |\n212\t\n213\t      | Vanilla (clean) | 72.3  | 72.3  | 72.3       | 72.3 ± 0.0   |\n214\t\n215\t      | TaxEI (clean)   | 76.6  | 76.6  | **61.7**   | 71.6 ± 8.6   |\n216\t\n217\t      | Random (clean)  | 74.5  | 76.6  | 76.6       | 75.9 ± 1.2   |\n218\t\n219\t      '\n220\t  figures_description:\n221\t  - Paired bar chart：Qwen 5-seed vs LLaMA 3-seed，V/T/R with error bars。 Direction一致（TaxEI最不稳定）但severity\n222\t    profile不同。\n223\t  - Seed-level dot plot for LLaMA：TaxEI s123 catastrophic outlier突出， Random三点紧密聚集。Annotated\n224\t    with catastrophic threshold line。\n225\t  - Detection rate comparison bar：Qwen 0% vs LLaMA 27%，分operator。\n226\t  analysis: 'LLaMA replication是median档的关键升级——将finding从\"single-model negative result\"\n227\t    升级为\"cross-model evidence\"——但3-seed limitation使其只能是preliminary。 Direction consistency（TaxEI\n228\t    unstable across both models）是可claim的； magnitude consistency不可claim（Qwen consistent\n229\t    -9pp vs LLaMA intermittent -3.6pp）。\n230\t\n231\t    最大reviewer risk是detection rate差异：如果LLaMA produces 27% detection而Qwen 0%， reviewer会argue\n232\t    the models learn fundamentally different representations from same data， undermining\n233\t    \"cross-model\" claim的validity。Counter：detection doesn''t improve recovery (LLaMA\n234\t    TaxEI detection 30% but recovery 69.5% ≈ vanilla 73.1%)，so detection is orthogonal\n235\t    to the stability finding。\n236\t\n237\t    Paper claim wording必须是：\"Structured error injection destabilizes training on both\n238\t    Qwen3-8B (consistent harm, 5-seed) and LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct (intermittent catastrophic\n239\t    failure, 3-seed preliminary), while random injection remains stable across both\n240\t    architectures.\"\n241\t\n242\t    '\n243\t- name: Scale Ablation (25K–50K trajectories)\n244\t  plan_id: scale-ablation\n245\t  description: '将训练数据从~500成功轨迹(4,358 clean samples)扩展至~2,500轨迹(~22K clean samples)，\n246\t    训练V/T/R三条件(3-seed each)。测试TaxEI failure是否primarily due to data scale。 ~$44 API\n247\t    + ~54 GPU-h (3-seed×3 conditions with DDP)。\n248\t\n249\t    '\n250\t  expected_results:\n251\t    scaled_vanilla_mean: 71.2\n252\t    scaled_vanilla_sd: 3.5\n253\t    scaled_taxei_mean: 64.8\n254\t    scaled_taxei_sd: 5.2\n255\t    scaled_random_mean: 66.3\n256\t    scaled_random_sd: 4.1\n257\t    gap_taxei_vs_vanilla_pp: -6.4\n258\t    gap_random_vs_vanilla_pp: -4.9\n259\t    gap_taxei_vs_random_pp: -1.5\n260\t    gap_reduction_pct_from_baseline: 29\n261\t    catastrophic_seed_fraction: 0.0\n262\t    training_lottery_range_pp: 12.0\n263\t    cohens_d_scaled: 1.05\n264\t    welch_t_scaled_p: 0.065\n265\t    welch_t_bonferroni_significant: false\n266\t    collection_cost_usd: 44.0\n267\t    unique_tasks_covered: 134\n268\t    trajectories_per_task: 18.7\n269\t  result_rationale: 'Median档预测scale-up narrows gap但不eliminate。核心逻辑：\n270\t\n271\t    (1) Vanilla受益最稳定(67.3→71.2%,+3.9pp)：更多clean data直接improve task completion， 无conflicting\n272\t    signals。接近ALFWorld的performance ceiling (~75-80% for 8B models)。\n273\t\n274\t    (2) TaxEI gap从-9.0pp缩小至-6.4pp(reduction 29%)：更多data提供更robust的clean signal base，partially\n275\t    buffering against injection noise。但fundamental conflict (structured error patterns\n276\t    vs clean trajectories创造contradictory gradients)不因 data volume消失——P2_SubGoalDeletion在任何scale下都会teach\n277\t    \"skip steps is OK\" 然后clean data teach \"don''t skip steps\"。\n278\t\n279\t    (3) Random gap缩小更多(-9.0→-4.9pp, reduction 46%)：random noise at scale tends to\n280\t    average out(law of large numbers)，而structured patterns maintain systematic bias。这一差异支持\"structured\n281\t    > random for harm\"的claim。\n282\t\n283\t    (4) Catastrophic seed fraction降至0%：5× more data stabilize training dynamics， eliminating\n284\t    the bimodal seed distribution。Training lottery range从19-23pp降至~12pp。 这是data scale的genuine\n285\t    positive effect——与\"task structure causes the gap\"不矛盾， 因为stability和mean performance是可分离的维度。\n286\t\n287\t    (5) Cohen''s d从1.58降至1.05(仍large但approaching medium)，Welch t=0.065(NS)。 在median档这意味着：effect\n288\t    real but smaller at scale, still insufficient stat power。\n289\t\n290\t    (6) ALFWorld diversity ceiling：2,500 trajectories ÷ 134 unique tasks = ~19 repetitions/task。\n291\t    PALADIN trains on thousands of unique API patterns。Our \"scale-up\" is actually\n292\t    \"repetition-up\"——Reviewer会correctly identify这个distinction。\n293\t\n294\t    Reviewer典型response：\"The gap narrows 29% at 5× scale, suggesting data volume IS\n295\t    a contributing factor. You cannot claim task structure is the ''primary'' cause\n296\t    without matching PALADIN''s diversity.\" Median档paper降级claim为：\"Data scale contributes\n297\t    to the failure (29% gap reduction at 5×) but does not fully account for it. The\n298\t    residual 6.4pp gap, combined with ALFWorld''s 134-task diversity ceiling, points\n299\t    to task-structural differences as a co-dominant factor.\"\n300\t\n301\t    '\n302\t  tables:\n303\t  - name: 'Scale Ablation: 500 vs 2500 Trajectories'\n304\t    content: '| Condition | 500-traj (5s) | 2500-traj (3s) | Δ     | Gap vs V |\n305\t\n306\t      |-----------|:------------:|:--------------:|:-----:|:--------:|\n307\t\n308\t      | Vanilla   | 67.3 ± 4.7  | 71.2 ± 3.5    | +3.9  | —        |\n309\t\n310\t      | TaxEI     | 58.3 ± 6.5  | 64.8 ± 5.2    | +6.5  | −6.4pp   |\n311\t\n312\t      | Random    | 58.3 ± 8.7  | 66.3 ± 4.1    | +8.0  | −4.9pp   |\n313\t\n314\t      | Cohen''s d | 1.58         | 1.05           | −0.53 | —        |\n315\t\n316\t      | Catast. % | 20%          | 0%             | elim. | —        |\n317\t\n318\t      '\n319\t  figures_description:\n320\t  - Performance vs log(training_samples) curve for V/T/R。Diminishing returns明显， persistent\n321\t    gap可视化。X轴annotate PALADIN 50K+位置(far right, extrapolated)。\n322\t  analysis: 'Scale ablation在median档是partial mitigation。Gap减少29%但persist——足以让reviewer\n323\t    同时argue \"scale matters\" AND \"structure matters\"。Paper需要honest framing： \"Increasing\n324\t    data 5× narrows the penalty from 9pp to 6.4pp and eliminates catastrophic seeds,\n325\t    indicating data volume is a contributing factor. The residual gap and ALFWorld''s\n326\t    diversity ceiling suggest task structure as a co-dominant factor.\" 这是比\"task structure\n327\t    is the primary factor\"弱的claim，但对median档reviewer可接受。\n328\t\n329\t    '\n330\t- name: Recovery Prompting (Few-Shot In-Context)\n331\t  plan_id: recovery-prompting\n332\t  description: 'Eval时为每个condition提供2/4个in-context recovery examples（展示error→detection→\n333\t    correction序列），测试few-shot能否isolate recovery knowledge vs training signal。 如果V/T/R\n334\t    equally benefit，说明recovery能力来自ICL而非SFT。Seed=42, 47 tasks。\n335\t\n336\t    '\n337\t  expected_results:\n338\t    vanilla_0shot_recovery: 61.7\n339\t    vanilla_2shot_recovery: 65.3\n340\t    vanilla_4shot_recovery: 68.1\n341\t    taxei_0shot_recovery: 59.6\n342\t    taxei_2shot_recovery: 63.2\n343\t    taxei_4shot_recovery: 66.0\n344\t    random_0shot_recovery: 63.8\n345\t    random_4shot_recovery: 68.1\n346\t    improvement_vanilla_4shot_pp: 6.4\n347\t    improvement_taxei_4shot_pp: 6.4\n348\t    improvement_random_4shot_pp: 4.3\n349\t    between_condition_4shot_anova_p: 0.78\n350\t    detection_rate_4shot: 0.15\n351\t    detection_rate_0shot: 0.0\n352\t  result_rationale: 'Median档预测few-shot prompting universally提升所有条件，无条件间差异。\n353\t\n354\t    (1) ICL provides \"what recovery looks like\" template——是LLM的general能力， 与SFT training\n355\t    regime无关。V/T/R同等受益(+4-6pp)证明SFT期间的error injection 没有创造任何可被ICL amplify的recovery\n356\t    capability。若TaxEI训练真的teach了latent recovery ability，应该看到TaxEI从few-shot中disproportionately\n357\t    benefit（additive effect: SFT recovery knowledge + ICL recovery template = super-additive）。\n358\t    实际结果：TaxEI improvement = Vanilla improvement = ~6.4pp → zero SFT contribution。\n359\t\n360\t    (2) Detection rate从0%→~15%：ICL examples provide detection template，LLM能 模仿format但不reliable执行。这与SFT\n361\t    0% detection对比：即使explicit error tag exposure during SFT不teach detection，但4个in-context\n362\t    examples partially do。 暗示SFT signal在fine-tuning过程中被downstream pattern corruption覆盖，而ICL\n363\t    operates at a more superficial level that preserves detection formatting。\n364\t\n365\t    (3) 4-shot improvement ~5pp mean modest——远低于closing gap to vanilla clean(67.3%)。\n366\t    Even with explicit recovery templates，embodied planning的cascading error nature\n367\t    使genuine recovery fundamentally hard。Models can detect ~15% of errors and still\n368\t    fail to recover from most of them。\n369\t\n370\t    (4) Reviewer视为\"expected given resilience finding\"——如果D041已confirmed resilience-not-recovery，few-shot\n371\t    control是belt-and-suspenders。Value在于 completeness而非novelty。Paper中应放Discussion短段而非main\n372\t    result。\n373\t\n374\t    '\n375\t  tables:\n376\t  - name: Few-Shot Recovery Prompting (seed=42)\n377\t    content: '| Condition | 0-shot | 2-shot | 4-shot | Δ(4s−0s) | Det.(4s) |\n378\t\n379\t      |-----------|:------:|:------:|:------:|:--------:|:--------:|\n380\t\n381\t      | Vanilla   | 61.7%  | 65.3%  | 68.1%  | +6.4pp   | 14.9%    |\n382\t\n383\t      | TaxEI     | 59.6%  | 63.2%  | 66.0%  | +6.4pp   | 14.9%    |\n384\t\n385\t      | Random    | 63.8%  | 66.0%  | 68.1%  | +4.3pp   | 17.0%    |\n386\t\n387\t      | ANOVA     | —      | —      | F=0.26, p=0.78 | —  | —        |\n388\t\n389\t      '\n390\t  figures_description:\n391\t  - 'Line plot: shots (0/2/4) × 3 conditions。三条线near-parallel上升， 证明improvement is\n392\t    additive-from-ICL而非condition-dependent。'\n393\t  analysis: 'Recovery prompting是clean control but在median档不改变paper narrative。 它confirms\n394\t    D041 from a different angle。Paper allocation：Discussion section 1段，\"In-context\n395\t    recovery examples provide comparable improvement across all conditions (ANOVA\n396\t    NS), confirming that error injection training does not create latent recovery\n397\t    capacity that can be unlocked by prompting.\"\n398\t\n399\t    '\n400\t- name: Per-Operator Deep Dive (Multi-Seed)\n401\t  plan_id: per-operator-deepdive\n402\t  description: '利用recovery-eval-multiseed的5-seed数据，对4个operator分别计算multi-seed TaxEI−Vanilla\n403\t    recovery delta。验证seed=42的local/global gradient是否replicate。\n404\t\n405\t    '\n406\t  expected_results:\n407\t    C4_5seed_taxei_minus_vanilla_mean_pp: 1.8\n408\t    C4_5seed_sd_pp: 12.5\n409\t    C4_fisher_p: 0.71\n410\t    P1_5seed_taxei_minus_vanilla_mean_pp: -1.2\n411\t    P1_5seed_sd_pp: 10.8\n412\t    P1_fisher_p: 0.82\n413\t    C1_5seed_taxei_minus_vanilla_mean_pp: -3.4\n414\t    C1_5seed_sd_pp: 11.2\n415\t    C1_fisher_p: 0.49\n416\t    P2_5seed_taxei_minus_vanilla_mean_pp: -4.1\n417\t    P2_5seed_sd_pp: 13.1\n418\t    P2_fisher_p: 0.38\n419\t    local_global_gradient_direction_preserved: true\n420\t    local_global_gradient_magnitude_collapsed: true\n421\t    spearman_locality_rank_vs_advantage: 0.6\n422\t    spearman_p: 0.42\n423\t    episodes_per_operator_cell: 57\n424\t  result_rationale: 'Median档per-operator gradient在multi-seed后collapse to noise。\n425\t\n426\t    (1) Seed=42的C4=+9.1pp基于11个episodes中1个flip(6→7)——本质上是coin flip。 5-seed聚合后~57 episodes/operator/condition给每个operator\n427\t    ~±8-13pp的SD。 C4的mean从+9.1→+1.8pp，Fisher p=0.71——signal消失在variance中。\n428\t\n429\t    (2) Direction weakly preserved：local operators(C4)仍slightly positive(+1.8pp)，\n430\t    global operators(C1,P2)仍negative(−3.4, −4.1pp)。但magnitude减小~70%，且 Spearman rank\n431\t    correlation(n=4)完全uninformative(p=0.42)。\n432\t\n433\t    (3) P2(sub_goal_deletion)保持最negative(−4.1pp)——合理因为sub-goal deletion是 most globally\n434\t    cascading的operator。但Fisher p=0.38 NS，无法distinguish from noise。\n435\t\n436\t    (4) 这个实验的value是将per-operator analysis从\"interesting pattern\"降级为 \"hypothesis for\n437\t    future work with larger benchmarks\"。Reviewer会agree这个降级。 Paper中从Results Table移至Appendix\n438\t    exploratory analysis。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t  tables:\n442\t  - name: Per-Operator Recovery Analysis (5-seed)\n443\t    content: '| Operator      | Locality | s42 Δ  | 5s Mean Δ | 5s SD   | Fisher p\n444\t      | N/cell |\n445\t\n446\t      |---------------|:--------:|:------:|:---------:|:-------:|:--------:|:------:|\n447\t\n448\t      | C4_obs_mask   | Local    | +9.1pp | +1.8pp    | 12.5pp  | 0.71     | ~57    |\n449\t\n450\t      | P1_step_swap  | Mixed    |  0.0pp | −1.2pp    | 10.8pp  | 0.82     | ~57    |\n451\t\n452\t      | C1_ctx_trunc  | Global   | −8.3pp | −3.4pp    | 11.2pp  | 0.49     | ~57    |\n453\t\n454\t      | P2_subgoal_del| Global   | −8.3pp | −4.1pp    | 13.1pp  | 0.38     | ~57    |\n455\t\n456\t      '\n457\t  figures_description:\n458\t  - Strip plot：每operator每seed一个点(20 points total)，massive scatter， zero line贯穿所有operators。Seed=42用红色标记为outlier-driven。\n459\t  analysis: 'Per-operator deep dive confirms this analysis is exploratory-only。对paper的impact\n460\t    minimal——main claims不依赖per-operator patterns。Appendix B一页足够。关键句： \"While the directional\n461\t    pattern (local operators neutral, global operators harmful) is consistent with\n462\t    our error cascading hypothesis, per-operator effects are not statistically distinguishable\n463\t    from noise at N≈57 per cell. Benchmarks with >200 diverse tasks are needed for\n464\t    per-operator claims.\"\n465\t\n466\t    '\n467\t- name: Scale-Up Data Collection (500→2500 Trajectories)\n468\t  plan_id: scale-up-data\n469\t  description: 'GPT-5.2 trajectory collection从501扩展至~2,500成功轨迹。分阶段：先1,000 check trend再决定2,500。ALFWorld\n470\t    diversity ceiling ~134 unique tasks。~$44 API cost。\n471\t\n472\t    '\n473\t  expected_results:\n474\t    phase1_1000_trajectories: 1000\n475\t    phase1_1000_cost_usd: 17.6\n476\t    phase1_1000_success_rate: 0.7\n477\t    phase1_1000_unique_tasks: 134\n478\t    phase1_1000_traj_per_task: 7.5\n479\t    phase1_1000_taxei_gap_trend_pp: -7.1\n480\t    phase2_2500_trajectories: 2500\n481\t    phase2_2500_cost_usd: 44.0\n482\t    phase2_2500_traj_per_task: 18.7\n483\t    phase2_2500_samples_clean: 21790\n484\t    phase2_2500_samples_injected: 18400\n485\t    phase2_total_training_time_h: 54\n486\t    phase2_wall_clock_ddp_h: 17\n487\t    diminishing_returns_500_to_1000_gap_reduction_pp: 1.9\n488\t    diminishing_returns_1000_to_2500_gap_reduction_pp: 0.7\n489\t  result_rationale: 'Scale-up data collection在median档是feasibility + diminishing returns\n490\t    story。\n491\t\n492\t    (1) Collection feasibility confirmed：70% success rate stable（与initial 501-traj\n493\t    collection一致），cost linear($8.86/500≈$44/2500)。无technical barrier。\n494\t\n495\t    (2) Phase 1 (1,000-traj) gap已经narrow(9.0→7.1pp)，phase 2 (2,500) further narrow(7.1→6.4pp)——clear\n496\t    diminishing returns。500→1000 gains 1.9pp， 1000→2500 only 0.7pp。Extrapolating logarithmically，5000\n497\t    traj would yield ~5.5pp gap——仍non-zero。\n498\t\n499\t    (3) ALFWorld diversity ceiling是fundamental：134 unique tasks × 18.7 repetitions\n500\t    = pure repetition augmentation。PALADIN''s advantage可能是task diversity (thousands\n501\t    of unique API call patterns)而非volume。Paper应explicit state： \"Within ALFWorld''s\n502\t    134-task diversity ceiling, data scale reduction accounts for ~29% of the injection\n503\t    penalty. The remaining gap likely reflects task-structural differences that cannot\n504\t    be resolved by repetition-based scaling.\"\n505\t\n506\t    (4) 训练resource significant(54 GPU-h total for 3s×3c)但feasible with 4×5090。 Question\n507\t    is ROI：这个experiment对reviewer的说服力是moderate——它addresses concern #10 partially but\n508\t    opens the door for \"you need to scale to 50K\" counter-argument。\n509\t\n510\t    (5) Median档reviewer response：将scale-up result视为evidence for mixed causation (both\n511\t    scale and structure contribute)而非clean separation。这是reasonable——我们 不能fully disentangle\n512\t    scale from structure within a single benchmark。\n513\t\n514\t    '\n515\t  tables:\n516\t  - name: Data Collection Scaling Summary\n517\t    content: '| Phase | Traj | Unique Tasks | Traj/Task | Cost  | TaxEI−V Gap | Δ\n518\t      from prev |\n519\t\n520\t      |-------|:----:|:------------:|:---------:|:-----:|:-----------:|:-----------:|\n521\t\n522\t      | Base  | 500  | 134          | 3.7       | $8.86 | −9.0pp      | —           |\n523\t\n524\t      | Ph. 1 | 1000 | 134          | 7.5       | $17.6 | −7.1pp      | +1.9pp      |\n525\t\n526\t      | Ph. 2 | 2500 | 134          | 18.7      | $44.0 | −6.4pp      | +0.7pp      |\n527\t\n528\t      '\n529\t  figures_description:\n530\t  - 'Diminishing returns curve: x=log(trajectories), y=TaxEI−Vanilla gap (pp)。 3 data\n531\t    points + logarithmic fit extrapolation to 5K/10K/50K。 Annotated PALADIN scale\n532\t    marker at 50K showing gap still projected >0。'\n533\t  analysis: 'Scale-up data是scale-ablation的prerequisite，结果一致。Diminishing returns 是key\n534\t    visual——logarithmic fit shows gap never reaches zero within any feasible ALFWorld\n535\t    scale。This supports task-structure argument but must be presented as \"suggestive\n536\t    projection\" not \"proof\"。\n537\t\n538\t    Paper allocation：Results section一段 + diminishing returns figure。Limitation section承认\"We\n539\t    cannot fully disentangle data scale from task structure within a single benchmark.\n540\t    Cross-benchmark validation (e.g., ToolBench replication of TaxEI) would provide\n541\t    stronger evidence but requires substantial engineering effort.\"'\n542\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3dbddd0c-fe11-423e-bc66-5161ab0e513e","uuid":"88615ce4-1d1e-4abc-9535-e5866f68812b","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:15:42.676Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/tax_error_inject_agent/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T153939/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claims systematic降级：(1)''Cross-architecture generalization''→''preliminary\n  cross-model evidence on two architectures''； (2)主finding→''large effect size suggestive\n  of harm, requiring larger N for confirmation''； (3)增加prominent limitations section：power=45%\n  at n=5, Bonferroni NS； (4)structured-vs-random divergence从''proves''→''suggests''；\n  (5)补充2×2 meta-analysis框架(PALADIN+EEF+TaxEI: {positive/negative signal}×{tool-use/planning})提升conceptual\n  novelty； (6)加入explicit power curve showing n=9 threshold for 80% power。 Reviewer\n  mean score 2.8–3.2 (Borderline Accept)。论文可发EMNLP Findings但tone从 ''definitive boundary\n  condition''变为''empirical evidence toward boundary conditions''。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Recovery Eval Multi-Seed (5-seed × 3 conditions)\n  plan_id: recovery-eval-multiseed\n  description: '将recovery eval从seed=42扩展至全部5个seed (42/0/123/1/7)，覆盖V/T/R三条件。 每条件47\n    tasks × 4 operators (P1/P2/C1/C4) round-robin注入。验证D041 resilience-not-recovery发现的跨seed稳定性。~15\n    GPU-h，需先retrain seed=0/123 checkpoints。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    vanilla_recovery_5seed_mean_pct: 67.1\n    vanilla_recovery_5seed_sd_pp: 4.9\n    vanilla_recovery_per_seed:\n    - 61.7\n    - 68.1\n    - 66.0\n    - 66.0\n    - 74.5\n    taxei_recovery_5seed_mean_pct: 57.4\n    taxei_recovery_5seed_sd_pp: 6.2\n    taxei_recovery_per_seed:\n    - 59.6\n    - 46.8\n    - 61.7\n    - 61.7\n    - 57.4\n    random_recovery_5seed_mean_pct: 57.9\n    random_recovery_5seed_sd_pp: 6.4\n    random_recovery_per_seed:\n    - 63.8\n    - 55.3\n    - 66.0\n    - 51.1\n    - 53.2\n    recovery_minus_clean_vanilla_pp: -0.2\n    recovery_minus_clean_taxei_pp: -0.9\n    recovery_minus_clean_random_pp: -0.4\n    detection_rate_qwen_all_seeds: 0.0\n    welch_t_taxei_vs_vanilla_recovery_p: 0.03\n    welch_t_bonferroni_significant: false\n    cohens_d_recovery_taxei_vs_vanilla: 1.53\n    per_operator_C4_5seed_taxei_advantage_pp: 1.8\n    per_operator_C4_fisher_p: 0.71\n    per_operator_P2_5seed_taxei_disadvantage_pp: -4.1\n    per_operator_P2_fisher_p: 0.38\n    per_operator_local_global_gradient_replicates: false\n  result_rationale: 'Median档核心参数recovery_clean_rate_match_pp=[0.0, 2.0]。5-seed recovery\n    eval 确认D041的resilience-not-recovery pattern：每条件recovery rate与clean eval rate 偏差<1pp（V:\n    67.1 vs 67.3=-0.2pp; T: 57.4 vs 58.3=-0.9pp; R: 57.9 vs 58.3=-0.4pp）。 模型通过任务完成能力被动忽略eval-time\n    perturbation而非主动检测修正—— recovery rate本质上就是clean task completion rate在noisy evaluation下的表现。\n    Detection rate维持0%（Qwen架构在任何seed/条件下都不产生显式error flagging）。\n\n    Per-operator patterns是关键降级点：seed=42中C4+9.1pp的\"优势\"基于N=11单个task flip(6→7/11)，5-seed聚合后collapse至+1.8pp(Fisher\n    p=0.71 NS)。P2保持weak negative direction(-4.1pp)但同样NS。整个local/global gradient从confirmatory\n    降级为\"directional observation consistent with error cascading hypothesis, requiring\n    >200-task benchmarks for per-operator claims\"。\n\n    这个实验的统计结构：5 seeds × 47 tasks = 235 episodes/condition for aggregate recovery claim\n    (adequate power for ~10pp effect)，但per-operator仅~55-60 episodes (grossly underpowered\n    for ~5pp operator-level effects)。Median档reviewer会accept aggregate resilience finding但要求per-operator移至Appendix。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 5-Seed Recovery vs Clean Rate Match\n    content: '| Condition | Clean 5s Mean±SD | Recovery 5s Mean±SD | Δ(Rec−Clean)\n      | Det. Rate |\n\n      |-----------|:----------------:|:-------------------:|:------------:|:---------:|\n\n      | Vanilla   | 67.3 ± 4.7      | 67.1 ± 4.9         | −0.2pp       | 0%        |\n\n      | TaxEI     | 58.3 ± 6.5      | 57.4 ± 6.2         | −0.9pp       | 0%        |\n\n      | Random    | 58.3 ± 8.7      | 57.9 ± 6.4         | −0.4pp       | 0%        |\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Per-Operator TaxEI−Vanilla Δ: Seed=42 vs 5-Seed'\n    content: '| Operator            | Locality | Seed=42 Δ | 5s Mean Δ | 5s SD   |\n      Fisher p |\n\n      |---------------------|:--------:|:---------:|:---------:|:-------:|:--------:|\n\n      | C4_obs_masking      | Local    | +9.1pp    | +1.8pp    | 12.5pp  | 0.71     |\n\n      | P1_step_order_swap  | Mixed    |  0.0pp    | −1.2pp    | 10.8pp  | 0.82     |\n\n      | C1_context_trunc    | Global   | −8.3pp    | −3.4pp    | 11.2pp  | 0.49     |\n\n      | P2_subgoal_deletion | Global   | −8.3pp    | −4.1pp    | 13.1pp  | 0.38     |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Recovery Rate vs Clean Eval Rate scatter (15 points = 5 seeds × 3 conditions)，\n    y=x reference line。Points cluster within ±2pp of diagonal，visually confirming\n    resilience-not-recovery。V=blue, T=red, R=orange。\n  - Per-operator dot plot：4 operators × 5 seeds的TaxEI−Vanilla Δ，large scatter 覆盖zero\n    line，seed=42 highlighted as outlier-driven。\n  analysis: '5-seed recovery eval的aggregate finding（recovery≈clean rate）是paper的strongest\n    confirmatory result——不依赖p-value而是qualitative pattern match。但per-operator gradient从Results正文降级至Appendix。Reviewer会accept\n    \"resilience not recovery\" 作为valid finding但不accept per-operator作为stand-alone claim。This\n    experiment changes paper structure: Table 3 (per-operator) moves to Appendix B,\n    replaced by a compact \"recovery≈clean\" comparison table in main text.\n\n    '\n- name: LLaMA-3.1-8B Cross-Model Replication (3-seed)\n  plan_id: llama-cross-model\n  description: '在LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct上复制核心实验：3 seeds (42/0/123) × 3条件 (V/T/R)。 同训练数据、LoRA配置(rank=16,\n    α=32)、eval protocol。验证TaxEI instability 是否跨architecture成立。~36 GPU-h。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    llama_vanilla_recovery_mean: 73.1\n    llama_vanilla_recovery_sd: 2.5\n    llama_vanilla_recovery_seeds:\n    - 74.5\n    - 74.5\n    - 70.2\n    llama_taxei_recovery_mean: 69.5\n    llama_taxei_recovery_sd: 8.6\n    llama_taxei_recovery_seeds:\n    - 74.5\n    - 74.5\n    - 59.6\n    llama_random_recovery_mean: 76.6\n    llama_random_recovery_sd: 2.1\n    llama_random_recovery_seeds:\n    - 74.5\n    - 76.6\n    - 78.7\n    llama_vanilla_clean_mean: 72.3\n    llama_vanilla_clean_sd: 0.0\n    llama_taxei_clean_mean: 71.6\n    llama_taxei_clean_sd: 8.6\n    llama_random_clean_mean: 75.9\n    llama_random_clean_sd: 1.2\n    taxei_sd_over_random_sd: 4.1\n    catastrophic_seed_fraction: 0.33\n    catastrophic_seed_id: s123\n    catastrophic_drop_vs_vanilla_pp: -10.6\n    catastrophic_drop_vs_random_pp: -19.1\n    taxei_mean_vs_random_mean_pp: -7.1\n    taxei_mean_vs_vanilla_mean_pp: -3.6\n    llama_detection_rate_mean: 0.27\n    cross_model_direction_consistent: true\n    welch_t_taxei_vs_vanilla_llama_p: 0.52\n  result_rationale: 'Median档cross_model_taxei_sd_ratio=[3.5, 4.5]，catastrophic_seed_fraction=[0.2,\n    0.33]。\n\n    TaxEI SD=8.6pp vs Random SD=2.1pp → ratio=4.1×，落在区间中间。这个ratio由 single catastrophic\n    seed(s123)驱动：s123 recovery=59.6%（vs vanilla 70.2%=-10.6pp， vs random 78.7%=-19.1pp），而s42/s0均=74.5%（与vanilla持平）。Pattern\n    mirrors Qwen 的catastrophic seed现象但表现形式不同：Qwen是consistent degradation（所有5个seed\n    都低于vanilla），LLaMA是intermittent catastrophe（2/3 neutral, 1/3 catastrophic）。\n\n    Reviewer challenge点：(1)\"n=3的SD estimate有极宽CI——单个outlier就能创造4× ratio\"。 这是valid的——remove\n    s123后TaxEI SD=0pp。但counter-argument是catastrophic seed 本身就是structured injection的核心failure\n    mode。(2)\"LLaMA detection rate 27% vs Qwen 0%——不同architecture在学不同的东西，cross-model\n    comparison的前提被undermined。\" 这需要在paper中讨论为architecture-dependent behavior。(3)\"3\n    seeds on second model is preliminary at best。1/3=33% catastrophic could be 0/10\n    with more seeds。\"\n\n    Random在LLaMA上mildly beneficial(76.6%>vanilla 73.1%,+3.5pp)——与Qwen(Random= Vanilla\n    degraded)形成对比。这支持\"unstructured noise is benign-to-helpful\"但也 表明effect magnitude是model-dependent。Paper必须从\"cross-architecture\n    confirmation\" 降级为\"preliminary evidence on two architectures suggesting direction\n    consistency\"。\n\n    Detection rate差异（LLaMA ~27% vs Qwen 0%）是unexpected finding。LLaMA-3.1的 instruction-following\n    tendency更强，可能使其more likely to verbalize error awareness 即使这种awareness doesn''t\n    translate to improved recovery。这实际上strengthens \"detection ≠ recovery\"的argument但需要careful\n    framing。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-Model Recovery Rate Comparison\n    content: '|              | Qwen3-8B (5-seed)  | LLaMA-3.1-8B (3-seed) |\n\n      |--------------|:------------------:|:---------------------:|\n\n      | Vanilla      | 67.3 ± 4.7        | 73.1 ± 2.5           |\n\n      | TaxEI        | 58.3 ± 6.5        | 69.5 ± 8.6           |\n\n      | Random       | 58.3 ± 8.7        | 76.6 ± 2.1           |\n\n      | V−T gap      | −9.0pp             | −3.6pp                |\n\n      | T SD / R SD  | 0.75×              | 4.1×                  |\n\n      | Catastrophic | 1/5 (20%)          | 1/3 (33%)             |\n\n      | Detection    | 0%                 | 27%                   |\n\n      '\n  - name: LLaMA Per-Seed Recovery Breakdown\n    content: '| Condition       | s42   | s0    | s123       | Mean ± SD     |\n\n      |-----------------|:-----:|:-----:|:----------:|:-------------:|\n\n      | Vanilla (rec.)  | 74.5  | 74.5  | 70.2       | 73.1 ± 2.5   |\n\n      | TaxEI (rec.)    | 74.5  | 74.5  | **59.6**   | 69.5 ± 8.6   |\n\n      | Random (rec.)   | 74.5  | 76.6  | 78.7       | 76.6 ± 2.1   |\n\n      | Vanilla (clean) | 72.3  | 72.3  | 72.3       | 72.3 ± 0.0   |\n\n      | TaxEI (clean)   | 76.6  | 76.6  | **61.7**   | 71.6 ± 8.6   |\n\n      | Random (clean)  | 74.5  | 76.6  | 76.6       | 75.9 ± 1.2   |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Paired bar chart：Qwen 5-seed vs LLaMA 3-seed，V/T/R with error bars。 Direction一致（TaxEI最不稳定）但severity\n    profile不同。\n  - Seed-level dot plot for LLaMA：TaxEI s123 catastrophic outlier突出， Random三点紧密聚集。Annotated\n    with catastrophic threshold line。\n  - Detection rate comparison bar：Qwen 0% vs LLaMA 27%，分operator。\n  analysis: 'LLaMA replication是median档的关键升级——将finding从\"single-model negative result\"\n    升级为\"cross-model evidence\"——但3-seed limitation使其只能是preliminary。 Direction consistency（TaxEI\n    unstable across both models）是可claim的； magnitude consistency不可claim（Qwen consistent\n    -9pp vs LLaMA intermittent -3.6pp）。\n\n    最大reviewer risk是detection rate差异：如果LLaMA produces 27% detection而Qwen 0%， reviewer会argue\n    the models learn fundamentally different representations from same data， undermining\n    \"cross-model\" claim的validity。Counter：detection doesn''t improve recovery (LLaMA\n    TaxEI detection 30% but recovery 69.5% ≈ vanilla 73.1%)，so detection is orthogonal\n    to the stability finding。\n\n    Paper claim wording必须是：\"Structured error injection destabilizes training on both\n    Qwen3-8B (consistent harm, 5-seed) and LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct (intermittent catastrophic\n    failure, 3-seed preliminary), while random injection remains stable across both\n    architectures.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Scale Ablation (25K–50K trajectories)\n  plan_id: scale-ablation\n  description: '将训练数据从~500成功轨迹(4,358 clean samples)扩展至~2,500轨迹(~22K clean samples)，\n    训练V/T/R三条件(3-seed each)。测试TaxEI failure是否primarily due to data scale。 ~$44 API\n    + ~54 GPU-h (3-seed×3 conditions with DDP)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    scaled_vanilla_mean: 71.2\n    scaled_vanilla_sd: 3.5\n    scaled_taxei_mean: 64.8\n    scaled_taxei_sd: 5.2\n    scaled_random_mean: 66.3\n    scaled_random_sd: 4.1\n    gap_taxei_vs_vanilla_pp: -6.4\n    gap_random_vs_vanilla_pp: -4.9\n    gap_taxei_vs_random_pp: -1.5\n    gap_reduction_pct_from_baseline: 29\n    catastrophic_seed_fraction: 0.0\n    training_lottery_range_pp: 12.0\n    cohens_d_scaled: 1.05\n    welch_t_scaled_p: 0.065\n    welch_t_bonferroni_significant: false\n    collection_cost_usd: 44.0\n    unique_tasks_covered: 134\n    trajectories_per_task: 18.7\n  result_rationale: 'Median档预测scale-up narrows gap但不eliminate。核心逻辑：\n\n    (1) Vanilla受益最稳定(67.3→71.2%,+3.9pp)：更多clean data直接improve task completion， 无conflicting\n    signals。接近ALFWorld的performance ceiling (~75-80% for 8B models)。\n\n    (2) TaxEI gap从-9.0pp缩小至-6.4pp(reduction 29%)：更多data提供更robust的clean signal base，partially\n    buffering against injection noise。但fundamental conflict (structured error patterns\n    vs clean trajectories创造contradictory gradients)不因 data volume消失——P2_SubGoalDeletion在任何scale下都会teach\n    \"skip steps is OK\" 然后clean data teach \"don''t skip steps\"。\n\n    (3) Random gap缩小更多(-9.0→-4.9pp, reduction 46%)：random noise at scale tends to\n    average out(law of large numbers)，而structured patterns maintain systematic bias。这一差异支持\"structured\n    > random for harm\"的claim。\n\n    (4) Catastrophic seed fraction降至0%：5× more data stabilize training dynamics， eliminating\n    the bimodal seed distribution。Training lottery range从19-23pp降至~12pp。 这是data scale的genuine\n    positive effect——与\"task structure causes the gap\"不矛盾， 因为stability和mean performance是可分离的维度。\n\n    (5) Cohen''s d从1.58降至1.05(仍large但approaching medium)，Welch t=0.065(NS)。 在median档这意味着：effect\n    real but smaller at scale, still insufficient stat power。\n\n    (6) ALFWorld diversity ceiling：2,500 trajectories ÷ 134 unique tasks = ~19 repetitions/task。\n    PALADIN trains on thousands of unique API patterns。Our \"scale-up\" is actually\n    \"repetition-up\"——Reviewer会correctly identify这个distinction。\n\n    Reviewer典型response：\"The gap narrows 29% at 5× scale, suggesting data volume IS\n    a contributing factor. You cannot claim task structure is the ''primary'' cause\n    without matching PALADIN''s diversity.\" Median档paper降级claim为：\"Data scale contributes\n    to the failure (29% gap reduction at 5×) but does not fully account for it. The\n    residual 6.4pp gap, combined with ALFWorld''s 134-task diversity ceiling, points\n    to task-structural differences as a co-dominant factor.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Scale Ablation: 500 vs 2500 Trajectories'\n    content: '| Condition | 500-traj (5s) | 2500-traj (3s) | Δ     | Gap vs V |\n\n      |-----------|:------------:|:--------------:|:-----:|:--------:|\n\n      | Vanilla   | 67.3 ± 4.7  | 71.2 ± 3.5    | +3.9  | —        |\n\n      | TaxEI     | 58.3 ± 6.5  | 64.8 ± 5.2    | +6.5  | −6.4pp   |\n\n      | Random    | 58.3 ± 8.7  | 66.3 ± 4.1    | +8.0  | −4.9pp   |\n\n      | Cohen''s d | 1.58         | 1.05           | −0.53 | —        |\n\n      | Catast. % | 20%          | 0%             | elim. | —        |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Performance vs log(training_samples) curve for V/T/R。Diminishing returns明显， persistent\n    gap可视化。X轴annotate PALADIN 50K+位置(far right, extrapolated)。\n  analysis: 'Scale ablation在median档是partial mitigation。Gap减少29%但persist——足以让reviewer\n    同时argue \"scale matters\" AND \"structure matters\"。Paper需要honest framing： \"Increasing\n    data 5× narrows the penalty from 9pp to 6.4pp and eliminates catastrophic seeds,\n    indicating data volume is a contributing factor. The residual gap and ALFWorld''s\n    diversity ceiling suggest task structure as a co-dominant factor.\" 这是比\"task structure\n    is the primary factor\"弱的claim，但对median档reviewer可接受。\n\n    '\n- name: Recovery Prompting (Few-Shot In-Context)\n  plan_id: recovery-prompting\n  description: 'Eval时为每个condition提供2/4个in-context recovery examples（展示error→detection→\n    correction序列），测试few-shot能否isolate recovery knowledge vs training signal。 如果V/T/R\n    equally benefit，说明recovery能力来自ICL而非SFT。Seed=42, 47 tasks。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    vanilla_0shot_recovery: 61.7\n    vanilla_2shot_recovery: 65.3\n    vanilla_4shot_recovery: 68.1\n    taxei_0shot_recovery: 59.6\n    taxei_2shot_recovery: 63.2\n    taxei_4shot_recovery: 66.0\n    random_0shot_recovery: 63.8\n    random_4shot_recovery: 68.1\n    improvement_vanilla_4shot_pp: 6.4\n    improvement_taxei_4shot_pp: 6.4\n    improvement_random_4shot_pp: 4.3\n    between_condition_4shot_anova_p: 0.78\n    detection_rate_4shot: 0.15\n    detection_rate_0shot: 0.0\n  result_rationale: 'Median档预测few-shot prompting universally提升所有条件，无条件间差异。\n\n    (1) ICL provides \"what recovery looks like\" template——是LLM的general能力， 与SFT training\n    regime无关。V/T/R同等受益(+4-6pp)证明SFT期间的error injection 没有创造任何可被ICL amplify的recovery\n    capability。若TaxEI训练真的teach了latent recovery ability，应该看到TaxEI从few-shot中disproportionately\n    benefit（additive effect: SFT recovery knowledge + ICL recovery template = super-additive）。\n    实际结果：TaxEI improvement = Vanilla improvement = ~6.4pp → zero SFT contribution。\n\n    (2) Detection rate从0%→~15%：ICL examples provide detection template，LLM能 模仿format但不reliable执行。这与SFT\n    0% detection对比：即使explicit error tag exposure during SFT不teach detection，但4个in-context\n    examples partially do。 暗示SFT signal在fine-tuning过程中被downstream pattern corruption覆盖，而ICL\n    operates at a more superficial level that preserves detection formatting。\n\n    (3) 4-shot improvement ~5pp mean modest——远低于closing gap to vanilla clean(67.3%)。\n    Even with explicit recovery templates，embodied planning的cascading error nature\n    使genuine recovery fundamentally hard。Models can detect ~15% of errors and still\n    fail to recover from most of them。\n\n    (4) Reviewer视为\"expected given resilience finding\"——如果D041已confirmed resilience-not-recovery，few-shot\n    control是belt-and-suspenders。Value在于 completeness而非novelty。Paper中应放Discussion短段而非main\n    result。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Few-Shot Recovery Prompting (seed=42)\n    content: '| Condition | 0-shot | 2-shot | 4-shot | Δ(4s−0s) | Det.(4s) |\n\n      |-----------|:------:|:------:|:------:|:--------:|:--------:|\n\n      | Vanilla   | 61.7%  | 65.3%  | 68.1%  | +6.4pp   | 14.9%    |\n\n      | TaxEI     | 59.6%  | 63.2%  | 66.0%  | +6.4pp   | 14.9%    |\n\n      | Random    | 63.8%  | 66.0%  | 68.1%  | +4.3pp   | 17.0%    |\n\n      | ANOVA     | —      | —      | F=0.26, p=0.78 | —  | —        |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: shots (0/2/4) × 3 conditions。三条线near-parallel上升， 证明improvement is\n    additive-from-ICL而非condition-dependent。'\n  analysis: 'Recovery prompting是clean control but在median档不改变paper narrative。 它confirms\n    D041 from a different angle。Paper allocation：Discussion section 1段，\"In-context\n    recovery examples provide comparable improvement across all conditions (ANOVA\n    NS), confirming that error injection training does not create latent recovery\n    capacity that can be unlocked by prompting.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Per-Operator Deep Dive (Multi-Seed)\n  plan_id: per-operator-deepdive\n  description: '利用recovery-eval-multiseed的5-seed数据，对4个operator分别计算multi-seed TaxEI−Vanilla\n    recovery delta。验证seed=42的local/global gradient是否replicate。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    C4_5seed_taxei_minus_vanilla_mean_pp: 1.8\n    C4_5seed_sd_pp: 12.5\n    C4_fisher_p: 0.71\n    P1_5seed_taxei_minus_vanilla_mean_pp: -1.2\n    P1_5seed_sd_pp: 10.8\n    P1_fisher_p: 0.82\n    C1_5seed_taxei_minus_vanilla_mean_pp: -3.4\n    C1_5seed_sd_pp: 11.2\n    C1_fisher_p: 0.49\n    P2_5seed_taxei_minus_vanilla_mean_pp: -4.1\n    P2_5seed_sd_pp: 13.1\n    P2_fisher_p: 0.38\n    local_global_gradient_direction_preserved: true\n    local_global_gradient_magnitude_collapsed: true\n    spearman_locality_rank_vs_advantage: 0.6\n    spearman_p: 0.42\n    episodes_per_operator_cell: 57\n  result_rationale: 'Median档per-operator gradient在multi-seed后collapse to noise。\n\n    (1) Seed=42的C4=+9.1pp基于11个episodes中1个flip(6→7)——本质上是coin flip。 5-seed聚合后~57 episodes/operator/condition给每个operator\n    ~±8-13pp的SD。 C4的mean从+9.1→+1.8pp，Fisher p=0.71——signal消失在variance中。\n\n    (2) Direction weakly preserved：local operators(C4)仍slightly positive(+1.8pp)，\n    global operators(C1,P2)仍negative(−3.4, −4.1pp)。但magnitude减小~70%，且 Spearman rank\n    correlation(n=4)完全uninformative(p=0.42)。\n\n    (3) P2(sub_goal_deletion)保持最negative(−4.1pp)——合理因为sub-goal deletion是 most globally\n    cascading的operator。但Fisher p=0.38 NS，无法distinguish from noise。\n\n    (4) 这个实验的value是将per-operator analysis从\"interesting pattern\"降级为 \"hypothesis for\n    future work with larger benchmarks\"。Reviewer会agree这个降级。 Paper中从Results Table移至Appendix\n    exploratory analysis。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Per-Operator Recovery Analysis (5-seed)\n    content: '| Operator      | Locality | s42 Δ  | 5s Mean Δ | 5s SD   | Fisher p\n      | N/cell |\n\n      |---------------|:--------:|:------:|:---------:|:-------:|:--------:|:------:|\n\n      | C4_obs_mask   | Local    | +9.1pp | +1.8pp    | 12.5pp  | 0.71     | ~57    |\n\n      | P1_step_swap  | Mixed    |  0.0pp | −1.2pp    | 10.8pp  | 0.82     | ~57    |\n\n      | C1_ctx_trunc  | Global   | −8.3pp | −3.4pp    | 11.2pp  | 0.49     | ~57    |\n\n      | P2_subgoal_del| Global   | −8.3pp | −4.1pp    | 13.1pp  | 0.38     | ~57    |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - Strip plot：每operator每seed一个点(20 points total)，massive scatter， zero line贯穿所有operators。Seed=42用红色标记为outlier-driven。\n  analysis: 'Per-operator deep dive confirms this analysis is exploratory-only。对paper的impact\n    minimal——main claims不依赖per-operator patterns。Appendix B一页足够。关键句： \"While the directional\n    pattern (local operators neutral, global operators harmful) is consistent with\n    our error cascading hypothesis, per-operator effects are not statistically distinguishable\n    from noise at N≈57 per cell. Benchmarks with >200 diverse tasks are needed for\n    per-operator claims.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Scale-Up Data Collection (500→2500 Trajectories)\n  plan_id: scale-up-data\n  description: 'GPT-5.2 trajectory collection从501扩展至~2,500成功轨迹。分阶段：先1,000 check trend再决定2,500。ALFWorld\n    diversity ceiling ~134 unique tasks。~$44 API cost。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    phase1_1000_trajectories: 1000\n    phase1_1000_cost_usd: 17.6\n    phase1_1000_success_rate: 0.7\n    phase1_1000_unique_tasks: 134\n    phase1_1000_traj_per_task: 7.5\n    phase1_1000_taxei_gap_trend_pp: -7.1\n    phase2_2500_trajectories: 2500\n    phase2_2500_cost_usd: 44.0\n    phase2_2500_traj_per_task: 18.7\n    phase2_2500_samples_clean: 21790\n    phase2_2500_samples_injected: 18400\n    phase2_total_training_time_h: 54\n    phase2_wall_clock_ddp_h: 17\n    diminishing_returns_500_to_1000_gap_reduction_pp: 1.9\n    diminishing_returns_1000_to_2500_gap_reduction_pp: 0.7\n  result_rationale: 'Scale-up data collection在median档是feasibility + diminishing returns\n    story。\n\n    (1) Collection feasibility confirmed：70% success rate stable（与initial 501-traj\n    collection一致），cost linear($8.86/500≈$44/2500)。无technical barrier。\n\n    (2) Phase 1 (1,000-traj) gap已经narrow(9.0→7.1pp)，phase 2 (2,500) further narrow(7.1→6.4pp)——clear\n    diminishing returns。500→1000 gains 1.9pp， 1000→2500 only 0.7pp。Extrapolating logarithmically，5000\n    traj would yield ~5.5pp gap——仍non-zero。\n\n    (3) ALFWorld diversity ceiling是fundamental：134 unique tasks × 18.7 repetitions\n    = pure repetition augmentation。PALADIN''s advantage可能是task diversity (thousands\n    of unique API call patterns)而非volume。Paper应explicit state： \"Within ALFWorld''s\n    134-task diversity ceiling, data scale reduction accounts for ~29% of the injection\n    penalty. The remaining gap likely reflects task-structural differences that cannot\n    be resolved by repetition-based scaling.\"\n\n    (4) 训练resource significant(54 GPU-h total for 3s×3c)但feasible with 4×5090。 Question\n    is ROI：这个experiment对reviewer的说服力是moderate——它addresses concern #10 partially but\n    opens the door for \"you need to scale to 50K\" counter-argument。\n\n    (5) Median档reviewer response：将scale-up result视为evidence for mixed causation (both\n    scale and structure contribute)而非clean separation。这是reasonable——我们 不能fully disentangle\n    scale from structure within a single benchmark。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Data Collection Scaling Summary\n    content: '| Phase | Traj | Unique Tasks | Traj/Task | Cost  | TaxEI−V Gap | Δ\n      from prev |\n\n      |-------|:----:|:------------:|:---------:|:-----:|:-----------:|:-----------:|\n\n      | Base  | 500  | 134          | 3.7       | $8.86 | −9.0pp      | —           |\n\n      | Ph. 1 | 1000 | 134          | 7.5       | $17.6 | −7.1pp      | +1.9pp      |\n\n      | Ph. 2 | 2500 | 134          | 18.7      | $44.0 | −6.4pp      | +0.7pp      |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Diminishing returns curve: x=log(trajectories), y=TaxEI−Vanilla gap (pp)。 3 data\n    points + logarithmic fit extrapolation to 5K/10K/50K。 Annotated PALADIN scale\n    marker at 50K showing gap still projected >0。'\n  analysis: 'Scale-up data是scale-ablation的prerequisite，结果一致。Diminishing returns 是key\n    visual——logarithmic fit shows gap never reaches zero within any feasible ALFWorld\n    scale。This supports task-structure argument but must be presented as \"suggestive\n    projection\" not \"proof\"。\n\n    Paper allocation：Results section一段 + diminishing returns figure。Limitation section承认\"We\n    cannot fully disentangle data scale from task structure within a single benchmark.\n    Cross-benchmark validation (e.g., ToolBench replication of TaxEI) would provide\n    stronger evidence but requires substantial engineering effort.\"'\n","numLines":542,"startLine":1,"totalLines":542}}}
