{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JMTuApQj64JQn5HyXSNDwf","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/tax_error_inject_agent/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 48\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 增加 random injection baseline，验证 taxonomy guidance 的增量价值\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: 如果没有 random injection baseline，无法区分\\\\\\\"taxonomy-guided\\\\n    injection 有效\\\\\\\"还是\\\\\\\"任意 perturbation 都有效\\\\\\\"。这是 A 类会议 reviewer 的 #1 攻击点。Random injection\\\\n    = 不按 taxonomy 分类，随机删除/交换步骤，用相同 teacher 生成 recovery。MVP 的 claim 从 \\\\\\\"TaxEI > vanilla\\\\n    SFT\\\\\\\" 升级为 \\\\\\\"TaxEI > random injection > vanilla SFT\\\\\\\"。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: vanilla-react-baseline\\\\n    role: existing baseline\\\\n    result: 42.6%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: '修正 MVP Pass/Fail #3: 拆分为 TaxEI>vanilla 和 TaxEI>random 两个独立 gate，random\\\\n    vs vanilla 降级为分析维度'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer warning: 原标准要求 random ≥ vanilla+5pp，如果 TaxEI 显著优于两个 baseline\\\\n    但 random 效果有限，原标准会判 MVP 失败——假阴性。random 弱于 vanilla 的结果（TaxEI > vanilla > random）同样支持核心\\\\n    claim：taxonomy guidance 是关键，随机 perturbation 不够。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 阶段选择 Option B（修正声明），不 over-claim environment-grounded；Option A（真实重执行）列为\\\\n    research 阶段增强\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 inject_and_generate.py 使用原始轨迹的 observation 而非重执行后的环境反馈，\\\\\\\"environment-grounded\\\\\\\"\\\\n    声明与代码不符。Option A（重执行）更科学但增加 MVP 复杂度——注入后环境可能处于不可能状态（如 P2 删了 pick，后续 put 全部失败），recovery\\\\n    prompt 的信息量不确定。Option B（修正声明）诚实且 MVP 可快速推进。当前实现的准确描述是\\\\\\\"recovery conditioned on\\\\n    corrupted action history + original observation at injection point\\\\\\\"。research 阶段可将\\\\n    Option A 作为增强实验验证 grounded feedback 是否进一步提升 recovery quality。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D004: RandomInjector 重新设计——使用与 TaxEI 完全相同的 4 个算子，去除 taxonomy 标签作为唯一变量'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出当前 RandomInjector 的 6 个 perturbation 中 4 个与 TaxEI 算子功能高度重叠，且\\\\n    plan_injections() 对两组都用 uniform 分配。当前设计比较的是\\\\\\\"算子设计质量\\\\\\\"而非\\\\\\\"taxonomy guidance\\\\\\\"。修正方案：RandomInjector\\\\n    使用与 TaxEI 完全相同的 4 个算子（P1/P2/C1/C4），相同注入数量和位置分布，唯一区别是训练数据中不包含 taxonomy 错误类型标签。这样\\\\n    Gate 3b 干净地测试\\\\\\\"taxonomy 结构化信息是否为训练信号增加了价值\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 11:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: v3 继续跑但不作 Gate 判定依据；追加 v4 同源双格式化实验（同一份 760 条注入数据格式化两次，TaxEI=Random=9,029，唯一变量=error\\\\n    tag）\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: v3 数据量不平衡（random 9076 > taxei 7545 > vanilla 4176），Gate\\\\n    3a/3b 有数据量混淆因素。v3 保留用于验证格式修复（vanilla 是否从 14.9% 恢复）。v4 采用同源双格式化方案：同一份 injected_variants.jsonl\\\\n    格式化两次（mode=taxei / mode=random），消除注入点、恢复内容、数据量所有混淆。Gate 3a 的数据量差异是方法本质属性，通过 random\\\\n    vs vanilla 分析维度分离数据量效应。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-vanilla-sft-v3\\\\n    role: format verification\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-taxei-sft-v3\\\\n    role: preliminary signal\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-random-sft-v3\\\\n    role: preliminary signal\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: D005 修正：v4 采用同源双格式化方案（非 subsample）——同一份 760 条注入数据格式化两次，TaxEI/Random 各 9,029\\\\n    samples，唯一变量是 error tag 文本\\\\n  rationale: 原 D005 描述为 subsample random injected 到 3,369，但 Agent 提出更优方案：同源双格式化消除注入点、恢复内容、数据量所有混淆变量，仅保留\\\\n    taxonomy tag 作为唯一自变量。已批准并实现。Reviewer 审查确认数据正确。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-vanilla-sft-v4\\\\n    role: v4 vanilla baseline\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-taxei-sft-v4\\\\n    role: v4 taxei (planned)\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-random-sft-v4\\\\n    role: v4 random (planned)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 新颖性自查：PALADIN(2025.09)是最大威胁——同为 taxonomy-guided error injection + recovery\\\\n    SFT。v3 vanilla>taxei>random 的 negative finding 可能是差异化切入点，等 v4 确认后决定 framing pivot\\\\n  rationale: 'Manager 要求新颖性自查。发现 PALADIN、STeP、Agent-R、AgentRefine 四篇 2025 年高相关工作。PALADIN\\\\n    核心方法与 TaxEI 高度重合（taxonomy-guided injection + SFT），差异仅为 error scope（tool-use vs\\\\n    planning/context）和 domain（ToolBench vs ALFWorld）。但 v3 结果 vanilla>taxei>random\\\\n    与 PALADIN 正面结果形成反差——error injection 在 embodied planning 上有害。这个 negative finding\\\\n    可能是更有价值的科学贡献（analytical paper: when does error injection help vs hurt）。需 v4 确认后决定是否\\\\n    pivot framing。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-vanilla-sft-v3\\\\n    role: 74.5% — best performer\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-taxei-sft-v3\\\\n    role: 66.0% — injection hurts\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-random-sft-v3\\\\n    role: 51.1% — random injection hurts more\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: v4 Gate 判定：Gate 3a FAIL（TaxEI=Vanilla 61.7%），Gate 3b FAIL（Random 66.0%\\\\n    反超 TaxEI 61.7%）。MVP 未通过，核心假设被否定。待排查 v4 数据/标签实现后做方向决策。\\\\n  rationale: v4 同源数据实验（taxei=random=9,029 samples，唯一变量=error tag）结果明确：taxonomy-guided\\\\n    injection 在 ALFWorld 上无额外价值。TaxEI 与 vanilla 完全持平，random 反超 TaxEI 4.3pp（虽无统计显著性）。v3\\\\n    的 vanilla>taxei>random 排序被证明由数据量不平衡驱动。v4 vanilla 比 v3 低 12.8pp 原因未明，需排查。结果可靠性确认后决定\\\\n    pivot/negative paper/终止。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-vanilla-sft-v4\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 61.7%\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-taxei-sft-v4\\\\n    role: treatment\\\\n    result: 61.7%\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-random-sft-v4\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: 66.0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: '选 Option C: Recovery-Specific Evaluation + 多种子验证。Clean-task eval 是错误的评估维度，taxonomy\\\\n    标签价值应在 recovery 场景体现。不终止项目。'\\\\n  rationale: v4 Gate 3a/3b FAIL 但评估仅覆盖 clean tasks（--no_inject）。Taxonomy 标签标注的是错误类型，其价值应体现在遇到同类错误时的\\\\n    recovery 能力，而非 clean-task generalization。Injected eval 是逻辑上正确的评估维度。同时 v3→v4 vanilla\\\\n    波动 12.8pp 需多种子验证排除噪声。这不是 pivot 而是修正评估方法。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-taxei-sft-v4\\\\n    role: 61.7% on clean eval\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-random-sft-v4\\\\n    role: 66.0% on clean eval\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 D009：D008 FAIL 不可撤回。Recovery eval 是补充分析（非替代原 Gate）。执行顺序：多种子先行 → recovery\\\\n    eval 预注册标准后再跑。终止条件：recovery eval 若 taxei≤random 则转 negative paper。\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer warning: D009 有 goalpost-moving 风险。修正：(1) D008 clean-eval Gate\\\\n    3a/3b FAIL 是最终判定，不可撤回；(2) recovery eval 定位为补充分析，测试\\\\\\\"taxonomy 在 recovery 场景是否有价值\\\\\\\"，不替代原\\\\n    Gate；(3) 多种子验证优先（seed=0/42/123 vanilla SFT，确认 v3→v4 波动是否噪声）；(4) recovery eval\\\\n    PASS 标准预注册：TaxEI overall recovery rate > Random, Fisher exact p<0.10；(5) 终止条件：recovery\\\\n    eval 若 taxei ≤ random → 转 negative result 分析论文，不再追加实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mini-vanilla-sft-v4\\\\n    role: 需多种子验证 61.7% 稳定性\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: D010 补充：Recovery eval 统计检验由 Fisher exact 改为 McNemar（配对检验更适合同 task 跨模型对比）。PASS\\\\n    标准不变：TaxEI recovery rate > Random, p<0.10。\\\\n  rationale: injected_eval.py 实现使用 McNemar test 而非 D010 预注册的 Fisher exact。McNemar\\\\n    对配对二分类数据（同一 task 上两个模型的成功/失败）更合适，是正确的技术选择。在执行前记录此修正，避免 post-hoc 检验选择质疑。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 20:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: D010 Phase 1 多种子验证结论：注入训练系统性损害 clean performance，TaxEI 均值 54.3% 远低于 vanilla\\\\n    65.3%，Gate 3a 彻底 FAIL\\\\n  rationale: 多种子 clean eval 结果明确：(1) Vanilla 3-seed 均值 65.3%±3.2pp（61.7/68.1/66.0），稳定；(2)\\\\n    TaxEI 2-seed 均值 54.3%（61.7/46.8），极差 14.9pp，训练不稳定且系统性低于 vanilla 11pp；(3) Random\\\\n    2-seed 均值 60.7%（66.0/55.3），也低于 vanilla 4.6pp。D008 的 TaxEI=Vanilla=61.7% 是巧合（vanilla\\\\n    最差种子 vs TaxEI 最好种子）。注入训练（无论是否有 taxonomy 标签）不仅无额外价值，反而损害 clean task 能力并增大训练方差。Recovery\\\\n    eval (D010 Phase 2) 是最后的验证维度——如果 TaxEI recovery ≤ random recovery，按 D010 规则转 negative\\\\n    paper。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-vanilla-seed0-eval\\\\n    role: vanilla seed=0\\\\n    result: 68.1%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-vanilla-seed123-eval\\\\n    role: vanilla seed=123\\\\n    result: 66.0%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-seed0-eval\\\\n    role: taxei seed=0\\\\n    result: 46.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-seed0-eval\\\\n    role: random seed=0\\\\n    result: 55.3%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:00 UTC\\\\n  summary: D010 Phase 2 recovery eval 确认 TaxEI 无价值：recovery 59.6% < vanilla 61.7%,\\\\n    detection 0%。终止条件触发，等 random recovery eval 补齐后正式转 negative paper\\\\n  rationale: TaxEI recovery eval 全部 47 tasks 完成：recovery 28/47 (59.6%) 低于 vanilla\\\\n    29/47 (61.7%)，detection 0/47 与 vanilla 完全相同。Taxonomy 标签在 recovery 维度也无任何可观测效果。综合所有证据：clean\\\\n    eval 多种子均值 TaxEI 54.3% << vanilla 65.3%，recovery eval TaxEI < vanilla，detection\\\\n    为零，训练稳定性 TaxEI 方差 2.3 倍于 vanilla。核心假设\\\\\\\"taxonomy-guided error injection 提供额外恢复训练信号\\\\\\\"在所有可测量维度被否定。D010\\\\n    终止条件\\\\\\\"recovery eval taxei ≤ random → negative paper\\\\\\\"基本触发（TaxEI 已 ≤ vanilla，random\\\\n    recovery eval 待补齐）。项目转 negative result 分析论文方向。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-recovery-eval\\\\n    role: D010 Phase 2 treatment\\\\n    result: recovery 59.6%, detection 0%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-vanilla-recovery-eval\\\\n    role: D010 Phase 2 baseline\\\\n    result: recovery 61.7%, detection 0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: D010 终止条件正式触发：TaxEI recovery ≤ Random，项目转 negative result paper。全 6 维度\\\\n    FAIL，核心假设被否定。\\\\n  rationale: 'Random recovery eval 完成（29/47=61.7%），TaxEI recovery (28/47=59.6%) ≤\\\\n    Random (61.7%)，D010 预注册终止条件触发。全维度汇总：(1) Gate 3a clean multi-seed TaxEI 54.3% <<\\\\n    Vanilla 65.3%；(2) Gate 3b TaxEI 54.3% < Random 60.7%；(3) Recovery TaxEI 59.6%\\\\n    < Random 61.7% = Vanilla 61.7%；(4) Detection 全部 0%；(5) 训练稳定性 TaxEI 方差最大。Taxonomy-guided\\\\n    error injection 在 ALFWorld embodied planning 上无正面效果，且注入训练系统性损害 clean performance。项目转\\\\n    negative result 分析论文方向——核心 angle: \\\\\\\"When does error injection help vs hurt\\\\\\\"，对标\\\\n    PALADIN 在 tool-use 上的正面结果，探讨 error injection 在 embodied planning vs tool-use 的效果差异。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-recovery-eval\\\\n    role: D010 Phase 2 control\\\\n    result: recovery 61.7%, detection 0%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-recovery-eval\\\\n    role: D010 Phase 2 treatment\\\\n    result: recovery 59.6%, detection 0%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-vanilla-recovery-eval\\\\n    role: D010 Phase 2 baseline\\\\n    result: recovery 61.7%, detection 0%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: D012 修正：3-seed TaxEI 均值 56.7%（非 54.3%），p>0.3 不显著。叙事从\\\\\\\"injection hurts\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"injection\\\\n    dramatically increases variance with no reliable benefit\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: TaxEI seed=123 eval = 61.7%，与 seed=42 完全一致（29/47）。3-seed 均值 56.7%±8.6pp\\\\n    vs Vanilla 65.3%±3.3pp，差值 -8.6pp 但 paired t p≈0.32 不显著。\\\\\\\"TaxEI hurts\\\\\\\" 结论完全由 seed=0\\\\n    (46.8%) 单独驱动，另两个 seed 与 vanilla 持平。更准确的叙事：error injection 不是稳定地损害性能，而是剧烈增大训练方差（SD\\\\n    8.6pp vs 3.3pp, 2.6x），使结果极不可靠。这是更 nuanced 的 negative result——injection 的问题不是系统性有害，而是引入了不可控的训练不稳定性。Claim\\\\n    1 从 \\\\\\\"statistically significantly degrades\\\\\\\" 修正为 \\\\\\\"introduces high variance with\\\\n    no reliable directional benefit, failing to meet the +5pp gate\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-seed123-eval\\\\n    role: 3rd seed completes TaxEI multi-seed\\\\n    result: 61.7% (29/47)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 00:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: D015 再修正：pooled permutation test 修复后 TaxEI vs Vanilla p=0.054 (NS)，所有统计比较均不显著。论文\\\\n    narrative 确认为\\\\\\\"方差效应 + 阈值效应\\\\\\\"而非\\\\\\\"显著退化\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  rationale: multiseed_stats.py 有浮点精度 bug（mean(a)-mean(b) vs mean(a-b) 在 n=47 边界情况产生\\\\n    ~1e-17 误差导致 p=0）。修复后：TaxEI vs Vanilla pooled p=0.054 (NS)，TaxEI vs Random pooled\\\\n    p=0.170 (NS)。即使统计功效更高的 pooled test (n=141) 也无法确认显著差异。论文主线确认为：(1) 方差梯度 Vanilla(3.3)<Random(7.0)<TaxEI(8.6)，(2)\\\\n    dose-response 非线性阈值 10%→0pp, 25%→-12.8pp，(3) 所有均值比较 NS。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-seed123-eval\\\\n    role: 3-seed completion\\\\n    result: 61.7%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-seed123-eval\\\\n    role: 3-seed completion\\\\n    result: 68.1%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject10-eval\\\\n    role: dose-response\\\\n    result: 61.7% (0pp)\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-eval\\\\n    role: dose-response\\\\n    result: 48.9% (-12.8pp)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: D016 扩展：完整 dose-response 揭示两个可分离效应——(1) 注入剂量阈值（10%→25% 双方均掉 12.8pp，共享机制）；(2)\\\\n    taxonomy 标签恒定惩罚（~6.4pp，跨所有 dose 点）。论文 narrative 升级为\\\\\\\"可分离双效应模型\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  rationale: Random dose-response 完成：10%=68.1%(+6.4pp), 25%=55.3%(-6.4pp), 50%=57.4%(-4.3pp\\\\n    vs vanilla)。TaxEI vs Random 差距在三个 dose 点几乎恒定（6.4/6.4/6.3pp），暗示 taxonomy 标签引入的惩罚与注入比例无关——是叠加在注入剂量效应之上的独立系统性偏差。两种方法从\\\\n    10%→25% 的跌幅相同（12.8pp），确认阈值效应是注入通用的数据稀释机制，非 TaxEI 特有。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-fixed-inject10-eval\\\\n    role: Random dose 10%\\\\n    result: 68.1%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-fixed-inject25-eval\\\\n    role: Random dose 25%\\\\n    result: 55.3%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-fixed-inject50-eval\\\\n    role: Random dose 50%\\\\n    result: 57.4%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject10-eval\\\\n    role: TaxEI dose 10%\\\\n    result: 61.7%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-eval\\\\n    role: TaxEI dose 25%\\\\n    result: 48.9%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject50-eval\\\\n    role: TaxEI dose 50%\\\\n    result: 51.1%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 03:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 审稿分析完成：proceed with writing, 6 项确认行动已派发\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream dream_20260515T020837 三档评分: Best 2/5（artifact: dream 自行捏造实验导致\\\\n    data integrity 扣分）, Median 3/5 (Borderline Accept), Worst 2.5/5 (Borderline Revise)。评分异常\\\\n    best < worst，因 best-case dream paper 编造了 WebShop/scale ablation 等实验被 reviewer\\\\n    查出。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    跨档一致的结构性问题（confirmed actions）：\\\\n\\\\n    1. Related work 从 ~8 扩充到 15-20 篇（Reflexion, McCoy, Mosbach, Madry, Bengio, D''Amour,\\\\n    ReAct）\\\\n\\\\n    2. PALADIN recovery-pairing confound 作为替代解释 [M][W]\\\\n\\\\n    3. F-test p=0.038 突出 + Levene''s test 补充 [B][M]\\\\n\\\\n    4. 论文 4 页结构：正文聚焦 main results + per-operator gradient + error echo\\\\n\\\\n    5. 自我矛盾（3 seeds vs ≥5 recommendation）显著承认 [M][W]\\\\n\\\\n    6. 数据量不对称 Vanilla 4K vs injection 9K 在 limitations 承认 [W]\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    观察项（等真实审稿验证）：novelty thin [W only], EEF 2×2 framework [M only], qualitative sample\\\\n    size [W only]\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    判断：proceed with writing。median 3/5 达标（borderline），结构性问题已全部转为 Paper Agent action\\\\n    items。不 re-dream（best 低分是 dream artifact，非 framing 问题）。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 03:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: Levene's test 确认方差梯度 NS：Claim 3 从 \\\\\\\"statistically credible\\\\\\\" 降级为 \\\\\\\"directional\\\\n    observation\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: F-test p=0.038 有 distributional assumption 问题（n=3, 非正态）。更 robust 的 Levene's\\\\n    test p=0.085, Brown-Forsythe p=0.842, bootstrap 69%。所有形式检验 NS。论文 narrative 调整：不再\\\\n    claim \\\\\\\"F-test p=0.038 是最强统计结果\\\\\\\"，改为 \\\\\\\"observed directional pattern, underpowered\\\\n    at n=3\\\\\\\"。这强化了 negative result story——所有效应均 indistinguishable from noise。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 03:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: F-test p=0.038 确认为计算错误，正确值 p=0.252。所有方差检验 NS。\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 手算验证：F(2,2) CDF 公式 P(F>x)=1/(1+x)，代入 F=6.95 得 one-tailed p=0.126,\\\\n    two-tailed p=0.252。p=0.038 来源不明，可能是 dream imagined_experiments 的估算值误传。已清理 paper_framing.md、ROADMAP.md、writing_plan.yaml\\\\n    中全部 p=0.038 引用。decisions.yaml 和 dream artifacts 作为历史记录保留不改。Paper Agent 已收到 URGENT\\\\n    修正通知。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 03:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: Per-operator delta 3/4 错误：从 \\\\\\\"smooth monotonic gradient\\\\\\\" 修正为 \\\\\\\"binary local/global\\\\n    split\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 从 autodl-5090 实际 eval JSON 验证，gen_fig2.py 硬编码的 delta 值与实际不符。正确值：C4(+9.1),\\\\n    P1(0.0), C1(-8.3), P2(-8.3)。原先声称的 C4(+6.1)→P2(-8.4) 单调梯度不成立——P1 实际为 0.0 打断单调性，C1=P2=-8.3\\\\n    说明 global 算子劣势相同。新叙事：binary local/global split，仍有意义但弱于 smooth gradient。paper_framing.md\\\\n    和 writing_plan.yaml 已更新。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-recovery-eval-r2\\\\n    role: per-operator source\\\\n    result: C1=66.7%, C4=63.6%, P1=58.3%, P2=50.0%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-vanilla-recovery-eval\\\\n    role: per-operator baseline\\\\n    result: C4=54.5%, P1=58.3%, C1=75.0%, P2=58.3%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: 审稿报告 Action Matrix 定稿：补多 seed dose-response + claims 重构 + 3 个 Reviewer\\\\n    遗漏修正\\\\n  rationale: Review Director Round 1 评分 Weak Reject (2.75/5)。识别 2 个系统性问题：(A) Claims\\\\n    overclaiming — 三个 boundary conditions 中只有 dose-response threshold 有合理支撑，但它也是单\\\\n    seed；(B) Underpowered design — n=3 主实验 + 单 seed 消融。Research Reviewer 独立审视确认方案方向正确，但指出：(1)\\\\n    dose-response threshold 如不补多 seed 也应降级；(2) 遗漏 v3→v4 不一致、Reflexion 引用、\\\\\\\"conservative\\\\n    estimate\\\\\\\" 措辞问题。决定补多 seed dose-response (seeds 0+123, TaxEI/Random × 25%/50%, 8\\\\n    runs, ~4h GPU)，同时 Paper Agent 执行全部 framing 修改。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-eval\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 48.9% (seed=42 only)\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-fixed-inject25-eval\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 55.3% (seed=42 only)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: D022 多 seed 完整数据颠覆 dose-response 叙事：从 threshold-plateau 改为 dual regime\\\\n    (deterministic harm at 25% + training lottery at 50%)\\\\n  rationale: 8 组多 seed dose-response 完成。关键发现：(1) TaxEI 25% 一致退化 47.5±1.2pp (confirmed);\\\\n    (2) TaxEI 50% 方差爆炸 56.0±12.4pp, seed=0=70.2% 超过所有 vanilla; (3) Random 50% s123\\\\n    也=70.2%, 异常非 taxonomy 特有; (4) \\\\\\\"shared 12.8pp\\\\\\\" 是 seed-42 巧合; (5) dose-response\\\\n    非单调 (25% mean < 50% mean); (6) 方差随剂量非线性 (25% SD=1.2 < vanilla 3.3; 50% SD=12.4\\\\n    >> vanilla). 新叙事：moderate injection = deterministic harm, high injection = training\\\\n    lottery. \\\\\\\"Training lottery\\\\\\\" 概念在 error injection 文献中未被报告。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-s0\\\\n    role: multi-seed\\\\n    result: 46.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-s123\\\\n    role: multi-seed\\\\n    result: 46.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject50-s0\\\\n    role: multi-seed\\\\n    result: 70.2%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject50-s123\\\\n    role: multi-seed\\\\n    result: 46.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-fixed-inject25-s0\\\\n    role: multi-seed\\\\n    result: 61.7%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-fixed-inject25-s123\\\\n    role: multi-seed\\\\n    result: 51.1%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-fixed-inject50-s0\\\\n    role: multi-seed\\\\n    result: 46.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-random-fixed-inject50-s123\\\\n    role: multi-seed\\\\n    result: 70.2%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Round 2 审稿 Action Matrix: 3 MF (checklist framing降级+Table 2 Δ修正+页数压缩)\\\\n    + 补 recovery eval 多 seed + Figure 1 3-seed 更新'\\\\n  rationale: 'Round 2 Borderline 2.75/5, Round 1 的 13/16 issues resolved. 剩余 3 MF\\\\n    均为低成本文本修改: (1) Conclusion checklist 从 \\\\\\\"boundary conditions\\\\\\\" 降级为 \\\\\\\"hypothesized\\\\n    conditions\\\\\\\", criterion (3) 改为 \\\\\\\"diagnostic feedback\\\\\\\" 解决与 Limitations 矛盾; (2) Table\\\\n    2 Δ列 10% 行改为 \\\\\\\"—\\\\\\\" 避免混合 baseline 误导; (3) Limitations 独立+§3.6 移 Appendix 压页数. 补跑\\\\n    recovery eval seeds 0+123 (~1h, GPU 空闲), Figure 1 更新为 3-seed 散点图. Reviewer 判断修改后可达\\\\n    Weak Accept.'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: '用户指令: 从 workshop 短文 (4p) 转为长文 (8p)，不再考虑 short paper'\\\\n  rationale: 用户认为 4 页太短。转长文需要补充实验（recovery-paired injection、第二环境）和深度分析。目标 venue 待定（EMNLP\\\\n    2026 主会/Findings）。核心机会：recovery-paired injection 可以把论文从 \\\\\\\"报告失败\\\\\\\" 升级为 \\\\\\\"诊断失败原因\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: Qualitative failure analysis 发现 TaxEI loop_repetition 2.2× 高于 Vanilla (49\\\\n    vs 22)，taxonomy 标签导致模型学到 fixation 模式\\\\n  rationale: Wave 1 任务 3 完成。TaxEI 失败模式中 loop_repetition 显著高于 Vanilla/Random，表明 taxonomy\\\\n    标签不是简单增加噪声，而是导致模型学到错误的\\\\\\\"修复\\\\\\\"行为并陷入重复循环。这直接回答了 \\\\\\\"noise vs wrong learning\\\\\\\" 的问题——答案是\\\\n    wrong learning (fixation)。此发现将成为 long paper qualitative analysis section 的核心内容。注意：当前\\\\n    Random 只有 seed=42 的 recovery eval 数据，5-seed 完成后需补齐以确认对比。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: qualitative-failure-analysis\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: TaxEI loop_repetition=49, Vanilla=22, Random=6\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Training dynamics: 训练 loss 跨 seed 极稳定(SD=0.0004)但 eval 方差 2.6×——injection\\\\n    危害在表征层非训练层。批准 post-hoc forward pass 获取 per-sample loss。'\\\\n  rationale: TaxEI final loss 0.1738 (token_acc 0.914) vs Vanilla 0.2942 (0.900)——训练指标更好但\\\\n    eval 更差，确认 training-eval paradox。关键发现：训练过程本身极其稳定（loss SD=0.0004 across seeds），eval\\\\n    的高方差完全来自学到的表征在不同 task 上的表现差异。这比\\\\\\\"增加训练不稳定性\\\\\\\"更有解释力，将细化 Claim 3 叙事。方案 A (post-hoc forward\\\\n    pass) 无需 re-train，几分钟完成。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: training-dynamics\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: training loss stable SD=0.0004, TaxEI loss 0.1738 vs Vanilla 0.2942\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 批准 Claim 3 从 \\\\\\\"training instability\\\\\\\" 改为 \\\\\\\"generalization instability\\\\\\\" + story\\\\n    arc 升级为因果链叙事\\\\n  rationale: D027 证伪\\\\\\\"训练不稳定\\\\\\\"假说：训练 loss 跨 seed SD=0.0004 极度稳定，不稳定发生在 eval/generalization\\\\n    层。D026 提供行为层 mechanistic 解释（loop_repetition 2.2×）。两个发现形成因果链：训练稳定地学到 fixation pattern\\\\n    (D027) → eval 表现为 loop repetition (D026)。Story arc 从\\\\\\\"描述 negative result\\\\\\\"升级为\\\\\\\"解释\\\\n    WHY negative\\\\\\\"——这是更深刻、更有投稿竞争力的论点。Claim 3 旧措辞（error injection increases training\\\\n    instability）与数据矛盾，必须改。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: training-dynamics\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: training loss SD=0.0004 across seeds\\\\n  - exp_id: qualitative-failure-analysis\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: TaxEI loop_repetition=49, 2.2x Vanilla\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: Forward pass 揭示注入样本被深度记忆(injected loss < clean loss)且 dose-response 单调递增，per-operator\\\\n    记忆深度与 recovery 损害反相关\\\\n  rationale: '5 个关键发现：(1) 所有注入模型 injected loss < clean loss，模型确实学到了注入内容但方向错误；(2) gap\\\\n    从 -0.016(10%) → -0.127(25%) → -0.197(50%)，注入比例越高记忆差距越大；(3) Clean loss 从 Vanilla\\\\n    0.685 → 50% 0.852，高注入破坏 clean 拟合；(4) Per-operator: C1 loss 最低(0.593)=recovery\\\\n    退化最大(-8.3pp)，C4 loss 最高(0.630)=recovery 唯一正向(+9.1pp)——记忆越深损害越大；(5) 完整因果链：overfit\\\\n    injection → behavioral fixation (D026 loop) → generalization collapse (D028)。这些数据直接填充\\\\n    §4.5 Training Dynamics Analysis，是长文核心 mechanistic evidence。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-training-dynamics-forward\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'per-sample loss: injected < clean for all injection models, dose-response\\\\n      gap monotonic'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: 5-seed Vanilla-TaxEI 差异达 p=0.039 (uncorrected)，Bonferroni 校正后仍 NS (p>0.017)。Claim\\\\n    1 \\\\\\\"NS\\\\\\\" 表述需条件化。\\\\n  rationale: TaxEI seed1 eval = 59.6%。5-seed 完整：Vanilla 67.3±4.7 vs TaxEI 58.3±6.5,\\\\n    gap=9.0pp, Welch t=2.506, p≈0.039, Cohen's d=1.59。Bonferroni 校正 (3 comparisons,\\\\n    α=0.0167) 后 NS。效应主要由 seed0 outlier (46.8%) 驱动——去掉 seed0 后 gap 缩至 6.1pp。论文表述更新：不能简单说\\\\n    \\\\\\\"no significant differences\\\\\\\"，改为 \\\\\\\"marginal significance uncorrected (p=0.039),\\\\n    NS after Bonferroni correction (p>0.017)\\\\\\\"。这实际上加强了 negative result thesis——TaxEI\\\\n    不仅没帮助，而且有边际显著的损害，但结论需受限于 seed variance 异质性。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: multiseed-taxei\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: '5-seed: 58.3±6.5%, p=0.039 uncorrected vs Vanilla'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: Random seed1=46.8% 灾难性 outlier 改变 variance gradient：Random SD(9.9%) > TaxEI\\\\n    SD(6.5%) > Vanilla SD(4.7%)。等 seed7 确认后更新叙事。\\\\n  rationale: 'Random 4-seed (缺seed7): 66.0/55.3/68.1/46.8, mean=59.1±9.9pp。原叙事\\\\\\\"Vanilla\\\\n    < Random < TaxEI\\\\\\\"(更结构化=更不稳定)被5-seed数据推翻——Random SD(9.9%) > TaxEI SD(6.5%)。两种注入都产生~47%灾难性outlier(TaxEI\\\\n    s0=46.8%, Random s1=46.8%)，Vanilla从未低于61.7%。新叙事方向：(1)注入本身是variance放大器，非taxonomy特异；(2)taxonomy可能有微弱稳定效果(降低SD)；(3)Claim\\\\n    2 \\\\\\\"taxonomy specifically harms\\\\\\\"需nuance。等Random seed7确认后统一更新paper_framing.md。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: multiseed-random\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Random seed1=46.8% (22/47), 4-seed mean=59.1±9.9%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: 5-seed 完整统计：TaxEI=Random=58.3% 均值完全一致，taxonomy 标签零收益。Variance gradient\\\\n    Vanilla(4.7)<TaxEI(6.5)<Random(8.7)。大效应量(d>1.2)但 Bonferroni 后 NS。\\\\n  rationale: '完整 5-seed 3-way 数据颠覆多个旧叙事：(1) TaxEI=Random=137/235=58.3% 完全一致——taxonomy\\\\n    在均值层面零收益，这是最强的负面发现；(2) Variance gradient 从 3-seed 的 Vanilla<Random<TaxEI 变为 5-seed\\\\n    的 Vanilla(4.7)<TaxEI(6.5)<Random(8.7)——taxonomy 可能有微弱稳定效果，与旧 Claim 3 矛盾；(3) 灾难性\\\\n    outlier: TaxEI s0=46.8%, Random s1=46.8%, Vanilla 最低 61.7%——注入引入随机脆弱性；(4) Welch\\\\n    t Vanilla-TaxEI p=0.039 uncorrected, Cohen''s d=1.58, Bonferroni NS——underpowered\\\\n    的大效应量。论文需重写 Claims 1-3 和 Finding section。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: multiseed-vanilla\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: '5-seed: 67.3±4.7%'\\\\n  - exp_id: multiseed-taxei\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: '5-seed: 58.3±6.5%'\\\\n  - exp_id: multiseed-random\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: '5-seed: 58.3±8.7%'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Forward pass v2 修正: dose-response 非单调, Random 记忆深度 2.1× TaxEI, 因果叙事降级为相关性'\\\\n  rationale: 'v1 的 turn-level 分类 bug 导致 monotonic dose-response 假象。v2 trajectory-level\\\\n    修正后: (1) gap 在 25%/50% 缩小 3-6× 且非单调(25% > 50%); (2) Random gap -0.078 vs TaxEI\\\\n    -0.037, 无 taxonomy 标签反而被更深记忆; (3) per-operator 排序不稳定, 弱化 \\\\\\\"记忆越深损害越大\\\\\\\" 因果链为 correlation。但核心\\\\n    finding 不变: 所有注入样本被更深记忆(gap<0), 50% clean loss 退化 +0.166。Random 更深记忆但 eval=TaxEI\\\\n    进一步支持 taxonomy 标签零收益结论。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-training-dynamics-forward-v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: non-monotonic dose-response, random 2.1× deeper memorization\\\\n  - exp_id: v4-training-dynamics-forward\\\\n    role: superseded\\\\n    result: v1 had turn-level classification bug\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: D017 \\\\\\\"10% = 零危害\\\\\\\" 叙事被 5-seed 推翻，dose-response 从 threshold 改为 monotonic-then-reversal\\\\n  rationale: '5-seed 10% 数据: TaxEI 61.3%±8.2 vs Vanilla 67.3%±4.7 = -6.0pp (d=0.90\\\\n    大效应), Random 63.8%±5.4 = -3.4pp (d=0.67 中效应)。原 D017 单 seed \\\\\\\"10%=vanilla\\\\\\\" 是巧合。正确叙事:\\\\n    10% 已有损害→25% 加剧(TaxEI 47.5%)→50% 反弹(56.0%)。不存在 safe threshold。方差结构也与剂量交互: 10%\\\\n    TaxEI SD>Random, full TaxEI SD<Random，否定简单 \\\\\\\"taxonomy 稳定方差\\\\\\\" 叙事。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dose-response-5seed\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 10% TaxEI 61.3±8.2, Random 63.8±5.4\\\\n  - exp_id: dose-response-taxei\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 25% 47.5±1.2, 50% 56.0±12.4\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D032\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: D023 \\\\\\\"dual regime (deterministic 25% + lottery 50%)\\\\\\\" 被 5-seed 推翻，改为 \\\\\\\"continuous\\\\n    dose-dependent harm + universal lottery\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: '25% 5-seed: TaxEI 52.7±7.6 (3-seed 47.5±1.2, SD×6.3 倍), Random 60.0±8.0。3-seed\\\\n    的极低方差是抽样巧合(s42/s0/s123 恰好落在 46-49%)，s1=63.8/s7=57.4 大幅高于。所有剂量均为 lottery(SD 5-12%)，不存在\\\\n    regime boundary。正确叙事: injection at all doses increases variance + reduces mean,\\\\n    25% TaxEI 显示最大 taxonomy penalty (7.3pp vs Random)。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dose-response-5seed\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 25% TaxEI 52.7±7.6, Random 60.0±8.0\\\\n  - exp_id: dose-response-taxei\\\\n    role: superseded\\\\n    result: 3-seed 47.5±1.2 was sampling coincidence\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D034\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 00:00 UTC\\\\n  summary: 25% TaxEI vs Random 显著(p=0.029)但 Bonferroni NS；维持 negative result framing，加\\\\n    dose-dependent taxonomy penalty 作为 secondary finding\\\\n  rationale: '25% 统计: Vanilla vs TaxEI p=0.004 d=2.63 (Bonferroni survives), Vanilla\\\\n    vs Random p=0.039, TaxEI vs Random p=0.029 d=1.49 (Bonferroni NS at α=0.017)。TaxEI\\\\n    dose-response 斜率是 Random 2×(0.58 vs 0.29 pp/%)。这不是 taxonomy \\\\\\\"works\\\\\\\"，是 taxonomy\\\\n    amplifies harm。决定: 维持 negative result paper framing，加 \\\\\\\"taxonomy labels amplify\\\\n    dose-dependent harm\\\\\\\" 作为 nuanced secondary finding。等 50% 5-seed 确认是否斜率差持续。不翻转论文方向。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dose-response-5seed\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 25% TaxEI vs Random p=0.029 d=1.49, TaxEI slope 2× Random\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D035\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 00:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D037: 修正 per-seed 数据污染——Vanilla s1/s7 和 TaxEI s1/s7 被 25% dose-response\\\\n    值覆盖'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 发现 ROADMAP 和 experiment_plan.yaml 的 5-seed 主表 per-seed\\\\n    值被 25% dose-response 实验结果污染。验算确认：错误值算出 SD 与报告不符（Vanilla 3.85≠4.7, TaxEI 6.83≠6.5），修正值算出正确\\\\n    SD（4.67≈4.7, 6.49≈6.5）。修正：Vanilla s1 72.3→66.0, s7 68.1→74.5; TaxEI s1 63.8→59.6,\\\\n    s7 57.4→61.7。Mean±SD 不变，但 per-seed 分析和 outlier 识别受影响。paper_framing.md 主条件不含逐 seed\\\\n    值，无需修正。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: 5-seed-extension\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: per-seed values corrected in ROADMAP + experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D032\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D038: 50% dose-response 5-seed 完成，dose-response 全线收官。Inverted-U taxonomy\\\\n    penalty: 25% peak (-7.3pp) → 50% (-0.9pp) → Full (0pp)'\\\\n  rationale: '50% s1/s7 eval 完成。TaxEI 50% 5-seed: 57.4±9.5 (51.1/70.2/46.8/63.8/55.3)，Random\\\\n    50%: 58.3±11.7 (57.4/46.8/70.2/70.2/46.8)。TaxEI-Random gap 从 3-seed 的 -2.1pp 收窄到\\\\n    -0.9pp。完整 dose-response 曲线确认 inverted-U taxonomy penalty (25% peak)。所有 5 个剂量 ×\\\\n    5 seeds 全部到位，dose-response 实验线关闭。下一步：recovery-paired SFT (Wave 2 核心实验)。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dose-response-5seed\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: all 5 doses × 5 seeds complete, inverted-U taxonomy penalty confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D036\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 02:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D039: Recovery-paired SFT 启动 (Claim 7)。数据设计: TaxEI 9,029 + Recovery 5,408\\\\n    = 14,437。4 seeds 并行 (42/0/123/1)。'\\\\n  rationale: 'Recovery-paired 是 Wave 2 核心实验，测试 PALADIN recovery-pairing 是否是 TaxEI\\\\n    失败的缺失成分。数据设计: recovery continuations 叠加在 TaxEI 基础上（不替换），recovery_only 模式提取恢复步骤。14,437\\\\n    vs TaxEI 9,029 存在 volume confound，但预期 negative result 下不成问题；意外成功则后补 volume-matched\\\\n    control。4 seeds 并行 ~4h/seed。50% 统计确认 dose-response 趋同: TaxEI≈Random at 50% (Δ=0.8pp,\\\\n    p=0.920)。Random dose-response 单调递减显著 (Spearman p=0.037)。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: recovery-paired-injection\\\\n    role: started\\\\n    result: 4 seeds training on 4 GPUs, ETA ~4h\\\\n  - exp_id: dose-response-5seed\\\\n    role: analysis\\\\n    result: '50% stats complete: TaxEI≈Random, Bonferroni NS vs Vanilla'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 03:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D040: WebShop replication 降级为 Discussion section 分析。Drop Claim 8。P1 无法适配\\\\n    WebShop 线性 action space，taxonomy 4→3 使跨环境对比不等价。35 GPU-h 转用于 recovery eval multi-seed\\\\n    + TaxEI-RP seed 7。'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 调研发现 P1_StepOrderSwap 在 WebShop 产生语法非法序列（action space 只有 search+click，高度线性）。Taxonomy\\\\n    缩减 4→3 使\\\\\\\"跨环境复制\\\\\\\"变成\\\\\\\"不同 taxonomy 的不同实验\\\\\\\"，给 reviewer 留把柄。12-17 天工期 + 35 GPU-h (64%\\\\n    剩余预算) ROI 太低。改为 Discussion 段落分析 ALFWorld vs WebShop 结构性差异，论证跨环境迁移的非平凡性。省下的 GPU-h\\\\n    用于 recovery eval multi-seed (Claims 4/5) 和 TaxEI-RP seed 7 (Claim 7)。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: webshop-replication\\\\n    role: cancelled\\\\n    result: downgraded to Discussion analysis due to P1 incompatibility\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 03:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D041: Recovery rate ≈ normal eval rate — 模型是 \\\\\\\"resilience\\\\\\\"(被动忽略错误) 而非 \\\\\\\"recovery\\\\\\\"(主动恢复)。Claim\\\\n    4/5 叙事需要修正。'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 审计发现 4 个未注册 recovery eval 的 recovery rate 与 normal eval rate\\\\n    精确一致（V s0: 68.1%=68.1%, V s123: 66.0%=66.0%, T s0: 46.8%=46.8%, T s123: 61.7%=61.7%）。唯一例外是\\\\n    TaxEI s42 (59.6% vs 61.7%, -2.1pp)。这意味着 eval-time 注入对模型性能几乎零影响——模型既不检测也不受影响。\\\\\\\"Recovery\\\\\\\"\\\\n    实际是 \\\\\\\"resilience\\\\\\\"（被动忽略），不是主动从错误中恢复。Claim 4 从\\\\\\\"不改善 recovery\\\\\\\"修正为\\\\\\\"eval-time errors\\\\n    被忽略，recovery=resilience\\\\\\\"。Claim 5 (detection=0%) 不变。这进一步强化 negative result：error\\\\n    injection 在 embodied planning 中不仅训练无效，连 eval-time 错误信号也被忽略。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: recovery-eval\\\\n    role: reinterpreted\\\\n    result: 'recovery≈normal: passive resilience, not active recovery'\\\\n  - exp_id: recovery-eval-multiseed\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 7/15 confirmed, 4 unregistered being fixed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 04:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D042: Scope 扩展——加 LLaMA-3.1-8B 跨模型验证 + scale-up 25K trajectories。用户指示\\\\\\\"尽量补实验\\\\\\\"。'\\\\n  rationale: 当前 scope (1 model × 1 env) 对 8 页长文偏窄。核心 claim \\\\\\\"task structure 是主因\\\\\\\" 但只有单模型证据。加第二模型\\\\n    (LLaMA-3.1-8B) 是性价比最高的扩展——同样数据同样流程，如果也是 negative result 则论证力翻倍。Scale-up 堵住 \\\\\\\"PALADIN\\\\n    50K vs TaxEI 9K\\\\\\\" 的数据量质疑。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: llama-cross-model\\\\n    role: new experiment\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: scale-up-data\\\\n    role: new experiment\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D032\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 06:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D043: TaxEI-RP (recovery-paired) 4-seed 结果: 47.9±7.8%, 比 TaxEI 差 10pp,\\\\n    比 Vanilla 差 19pp。Recovery pairing 不是 PALADIN 成功的关键要素，task structure 确认为根本限制。Claim\\\\n    7 定论。'\\\\n  rationale: 'TaxEI-RP mean 47.9% (s42=38.3/s0=46.8/s1=48.9/s123=57.4) vs TaxEI 58.3%\\\\n    vs Vanilla 67.3%。Recovery continuation 训练数据 (+5,408 samples) 不仅未改善 recovery，反而进一步恶化性能。这排除了\\\\\\\"PALADIN\\\\n    成功是因为 recovery pairing\\\\\\\"的替代解释，确认 task structure (error observability, local recoverability,\\\\n    bounded action space) 是 error injection 成败的主要因素。Detection rate 仍为 0%。论文 Reviewer\\\\n    Concern #8 现在有直接实验证据回应。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: recovery-paired-injection\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 47.9±7.8% (4-seed), worse than TaxEI and Vanilla\\\\n  - exp_id: multiseed-taxei\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 58.3±6.5%\\\\n  - exp_id: multiseed-vanilla\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 67.3±4.7%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n  - D041\\\\n- id: D044\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 06:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D044: Scale-up 数据收集暂停——成功率从 70% 崩到 9.3%，1000 目标不可行。需诊断原因后决定是否重试或放弃。'\\\\n  rationale: Phase 1 收集 810 次尝试仅 76 成功 (9.3%)，远低于历史 70.2%。按此速率，3000 次尝试只能得 ~280 条，不满足\\\\n    1000 目标。可能原因：排除已用 714 easy games 后剩余 pool 系统性更难；API/seed 差异；代码 bug。已花 ~$10 API\\\\n    成本。Kill 进程后诊断。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: scale-up-data\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 76/810 success (9.3%), paused\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D042\\\\n- id: D045\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 07:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D045: Scope 最终判断——当前 scope 含 LLaMA 3-seed + recovery eval 补完即可支撑 EMNLP\\\\n    Findings long paper。LLaMA 从 1-seed 扩到 3-seed (s42/s0/s123)，recovery eval 补完 8/15，scale-up\\\\n    诊断但不阻塞论文。'\\\\n  rationale: 8 页长文负面结果论文需要：(1) 跨模型验证排除 model-specific artifact — LLaMA 3-seed V/T/R\\\\n    提供统计可靠的第二数据点；(2) 完整 recovery eval 支撑 Claims 4/5 的多 seed 结论；(3) TaxEI-RP (D043)\\\\n    已排除最大替代解释。单环境是残留风险但工程上无法解决（WebShop D040 已证明）。Scale-up 9.3% 成功率需诊断——如果是 bug 则修复重跑，如果是\\\\n    pool 难度则本身是有价值的数据点。EEF 正向对照和第二环境放弃——ROI 不足。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: llama-cross-model\\\\n    role: scope expansion\\\\n    result: s42 training in progress, extend to 3-seed\\\\n  - exp_id: recovery-eval-multiseed\\\\n    role: completion required\\\\n    result: 7/15 done, 8 remaining\\\\n  - exp_id: scale-up-data\\\\n    role: diagnose\\\\n    result: paused at 9.3% success rate\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D042\\\\n  - D043\\\\n  - D044\\\\n- id: D046\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 07:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D046: 撤销 D044 scale-up 暂停——9.3% 成功率是统计口径错误（714 exclusion stubs 被计为失败），真实成功率\\\\n    77.9%。重启收集。'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 诊断确认：818 条记录中 714 是 phase 0 去重标记（task_type=exclude），实际 API 尝试仅\\\\n    104 条，成功 81 条 = 77.9%。进程仅跑 51 分钟就被误杀。按 127.5 条/小时吞吐，再跑 ~4h 可收集 500 条。Scale-up\\\\n    完全可行，重启收集。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: scale-up-data\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: actual success rate 77.9%, restart collection\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D044\\\\n- id: D047\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 15:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: LLaMA 3-seed 完成：TaxEI 跨模型不稳定确认，paper framing 升级为\\\\\\\"结构化注入训练不稳定性\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: LLaMA 3-seed 数据齐全。TaxEI recovery SD=8.6% vs Random SD=2.1%，1/3 seed (s123)\\\\n    触发 catastrophic degradation (59.6% vs vanilla 70.2%)。\\\\\\\"LLaMA 中性\\\\\\\"假说不成立。新 framing：结构化错误注入跨模型导致训练不稳定，Random\\\\n    注入跨模型稳定。新增 Claim 9。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: llama31-vanilla-s123\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: clean=72.3%, recovery=70.2%\\\\n  - exp_id: llama31-taxei-s123\\\\n    role: treatment\\\\n    result: clean=61.7%, recovery=59.6% — catastrophic\\\\n  - exp_id: llama31-random-s123\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: clean=76.6%, recovery=78.7% — stable\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D045\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 34886, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SfVBGkmTnqCYQUegZczMa7","session_id":"3dbddd0c-fe11-423e-bc66-5161ab0e513e","uuid":"69f989c1-a972-4d4f-b608-ccca7129bf2f","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:16:55.243Z"}
