{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G2xsHhick5ow2jKAgaS9eB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/tax_error_inject_agent/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- llama31-random-s123-injected-evalseed42（准备中）\\\\n- llama31-taxei-s123-injected-evalseed42（准备中）\\\\n- llama31-vanilla-s123-injected-evalseed42（准备中）\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-s123-eval（准备中）\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-s0-eval（准备中）\\\\n- v4-random-fixed-inject10-s0-eval-r2: v4 Random 10% seed=0 eval (retry, OOM fix) — 47 ALFWorld clean tasks. Dedicated GPU.（准备中）\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject10-s123-eval-r2: v4 TaxEI 10% seed=123 eval (retry, OOM fix) — 47 ALFWorld clean tasks. Dedicated GPU.（准备中）\\\\n- v4-taxei-inject10-seed0（准备中）\\\\n- v4-random-inject10-seed0（准备中）\\\\n- v4-taxei-inject10-seed123（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 38 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **llama31-random-s123-injected** (success): —\\\\n- **llama31-taxei-s123-injected** (success): —\\\\n- **llama31-taxei-s123-eval** (success): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 131 / 负向 5 / 失败 7 / 共 144\\\\ndetection_rate: 0.533 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\\\nrecovery_rate: 0.689 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject25: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject10-s123-eval: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- v4-random-fixed-inject10-s0-eval: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject10-s1-eval: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-s7-eval: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-s1-eval-r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject50-s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- v4-random-fixed-inject50-s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1415, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012ubrrVpxLRhm1bwpL8HYe2","session_id":"3dbddd0c-fe11-423e-bc66-5161ab0e513e","uuid":"e5b29156-8db5-4d09-8ec5-70079390cf18","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:17:00.734Z"}
