{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013u3W1SG5TVMQ1vyZHy32Wn","type":"tool_result","content":"395\t\\newblock PALADIN: Leveraging Tool-Use Failure Taxonomies for Robust LLM Agent Training.\n396\t\\newblock \\emph{arXiv preprint arXiv:2509.25238}, 2025.\n397\t\n398\t\\bibitem{zhang2025eef}\n399\tZhang et al.\n400\t\\newblock EEF: Extracting Effective Signals from Failed Agent Trajectories.\n401\t\\newblock \\emph{arXiv preprint arXiv:2504.13145}, 2025.\n402\t\n403\t\\bibitem{shridhar2021alfworld}\n404\tShridhar, M. et al.\n405\t\\newblock ALFWorld: Aligning Text and Embodied Environments for Interactive Learning.\n406\t\\newblock In \\emph{Proc.\\ ICLR}, 2021.\n407\t\n408\t\\bibitem{yao2023react}\n409\tYao, S. et al.\n410\t\\newblock ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models.\n411\t\\newblock In \\emph{Proc.\\ ICLR}, 2023.\n412\t\n413\t\\bibitem{yao2022webshop}\n414\tYao, S. et al.\n415\t\\newblock WebShop: Towards Scalable Real-World Web Interaction with Grounded Language Agents.\n416\t\\newblock In \\emph{Proc.\\ NeurIPS}, 2022.\n417\t\n418\t\\bibitem{song2024trial}\n419\tSong, Y. et al.\n420\t\\newblock Trial and Error: Exploration-Based Trajectory Optimization for LLM Agents.\n421\t\\newblock In \\emph{Proc.\\ ACL}, 2024.\n422\t\n423\t\\bibitem{bishop1995training}\n424\tBishop, C.M.\n425\t\\newblock Training with Noise is Equivalent to Tikhonov Regularization.\n426\t\\newblock \\emph{Neural Computation}, 7(1):108--116, 1995.\n427\t\n428\t\\bibitem{natarajan2013learning}\n429\tNatarajan, N. et al.\n430\t\\newblock Learning with Noisy Labels.\n431\t\\newblock In \\emph{Proc.\\ NeurIPS}, 2013.\n432\t\n433\t\\end{thebibliography}\n434\t\n435\t\\end{document}\n436\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SfVBGkmTnqCYQUegZczMa7","session_id":"3dbddd0c-fe11-423e-bc66-5161ab0e513e","uuid":"d2caf424-2bdf-4195-b0b8-e829b389ad50","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:17:11.800Z"}
